hadiths[400]{hadithnumber,text}:
"267","Hazrat Safina (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) eik mudd (pani) sey wuzu aur eik saa ( pani) sey ghusl kar liya kartey they."
"268","Humein Abu Bakr bin Abi Shayba ne hadith sunayi, unhone Yazeed bin Haroon se, unhone Hammaam se, unhone Qataadah se, unhone Safiyyah bint Shayba se, unhone Aisha (radiallahu anha) se rivayat kiya ki unhone kaha: Rasool Allah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ek mud (pani ki miqdaar) se wuzu karte the aur ek saa' (pani ki miqdaar) se ghusl karte the."
"269","Hazrat Jabir (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) eik Mudd (pani ) sey wuzu aur eik saa ( pani) sey ghusl farmatey they."
"270","Hazrat Aqeel bin Abu-Talib (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : wuzu key liye eik mud (pani) aur ghusl key liye eik saa (pani) kafi hai. eik aadmi ney kaha : hamarey liye to kafi nahin hota. Hazrat Aqeel (Raziallahu anhu) ney farmaya : in ko to kafi hota tha jo tujh sey afzal they aur unkey baal bhi tujh sey ziyada they, yani Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam)."
"271","Humein Muhammad bin Bashshar ne hadith sunayi, unhone Yahya bin Saeed aur Muhammad bin Ja'far se, aur humein Bakr bin Khalaf Abu Bishr ne bhi, unhone Yazeed bin Zurai' se, un sab ne kaha: humein Shu'ba ne Qataadah se, unhone Abu al-Malih bin Usamah se, unhone apne baap Usamah bin Umair al-Hudhali se rivayat kiya, unhone kaha: Rasool Allah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: \Allah ta'ala namaz ko qubool nahi karta magar tahoorat (paakizgi) ke saath"","" aur na hi ghulool (khayanat ka maal) ka sadaqah qubool karta hai.\""\nAur Abu Bakr bin Abi Shayba ne humein hadith sunayi"","" unhone Ubayd bin Saeed aur Shababa bin Sawwar se"","" unhone Shu'ba se isi tarah rivayat kiya."""""
"272","Humein Ali bin Muhammad ne hadith sunayi, unhone Wakee' se, unhone Isra'eel se, unhone Simak se, aur humein Muhammad bin Yahya ne hadith sunayi, unhone Wahb bin Jarir se, unhone Shu'ba se, unhone Simak bin Harb se, unhone Mus'ab bin Sa'd se, unhone Ibn Umar (radiallahu anhuma) se rivayat kiya ki unhone kaha: Rasool Allah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: \Allah ta'ala namaz ko qubool nahi karta magar tahoorat ke saath"","" aur na ghulool ka sadaqah qubool karta hai.\"""""""
"273","Hazrat Anas bin Malik (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : mainey Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) sey suna , aap farma rahey they : Allah Taala paakizgi key baghair namaz qubul nahin farmata aur khayanat key maal mein sey sadqa qubul nahin farmata."
"274","Hazrat abu-Bakra (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : Allah Taala paakizgi key baghair namaz qubul nahin farmata aur khayanat key maal mein sey sadqa qubul nahin farmata."
"275","Hazrat Ali (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : namaz ki kunji, paakizgi hai aur namaz ki Tehreem (is mein paabandiyaan laganey wali chiz) takbir hai aur namaz ki tahleel (is mein paabandiyaan khatam karney wali chiz) salam hai."
"276","Humein Suwaid bin Saeed ne hadith sunayi, unhone Ali bin Mushir se, unhone Abu Sufyan Tarif as-Sa'di se, aur humein Abu Kuraib Muhammad bin al-A'la ne hadith sunayi, unhone Abu Muawiyah se, unhone Abu Sufyan as-Sa'di se, unhone Abu Nadrah se, unhone Abu Saeed al-Khudri (radiallahu anhu) se, unhone Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se rivayat kiya ki aap ne farmaya: \Namaz ki kunji tahoorat (paakizgi) hai"","" aur iska tahreem (haram karna) takbeer hai"","" aur iska tahleel (halaal karna) tasleem hai.\"""""""
"277","Hazrat Soban (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, Allah key Rasool (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : sidhi raah par qaaim raho aur tum (haq ke mutabiq) qaaim nahin reh sako gey, aur tumhen malum hona chahiye ke tumhara behtareen amal namaz hai aur wuzu ki hifazat momin hi karta hai."
"278","Hazrat Abdullah bin Amr (Raziallahu anhuma) sey riwayat hai, Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : sidhi raah par qaaim raho , aur tum (haq ke mutabiq) qaaim nahin reh sako gey, aur tumhen malum hona chahiye ke tumhara afzal amal namaz hai aur wuzu ki hifazat momin hi karta hai."
"279","Hazrat abu-Umama (Raziallahu anhu) sey marfooan riwayat hai, Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : sidhi raah par qaaim raho aur kitna achchha ho agar tum qaaim reh sako, aur tumhara behtareen amal namaz hai aur wuzu ki hifazat momin hi karta hai."
"280","Hazrat Abu-Malik Ash-ari (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : pura (achchhi tarah) wuzu karna nisf (aadha) eman hai aur Alhamdulillah sey (aamal ka) tarazu bhar jata hai aur tasbih aur takbir sey aasman aur zamin pur ho jatey hain, namaz Noor hai, zakat daleel hai, sabr roshni hai, Quran terey haq mein ya terey khilaf eik hujjat hai, har shakhs subah ko apney aap ko farokht karta hai, khud ko azad kar leta hai ya tabah kar leta hai."
"281","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : tum mein sey koi shakhs jab wuzu karta hai aur achchhi tarah (khoob sanwaar kar) wuzu karta hai, phir masjid mein aata hai, usey namaz key ilawa koi aur maqsad ghar sey nahin nikaalta, (aisa shakhs) jo qadam bhi uthata hai, uskey badley Allah Taala uska eik darja buland farmata hai aur eik gunah maaf karta hai. (usey musalsal ye sawab milta rehta hai) yahan tak key wo masjid mein dakhil ho jata hai."
"282","Hazrat Abdullah Sunabihi (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : jo shakhs wuzu karta hai aur (wuzu kartey huye) kulli karta aur naak mein pani daalta hai to uskey munh aur naak sey gunah nikal jatey hain, phir jab chehra dhota hai to uskey chehrey sey gunah nikal jatey hain yahan tak key uski aakhon key papoton sey bhi nikal jatey hain. phir jab apney haath dhota hai to uskey haathon sey gunah nikal jatey hain, phir jab sar ka masah karta hai to uskey sar sey gunah nikal jatey hain, yahan tak key kanon mein sey bhi nikal jatey hain. phir jab apney paon dhota hai to uskey paon sey gunah nikal jatey hain. hattaa key paon key naakhunon key nichey sey bhi nikal jatey hain phir uski namaz aur uska masjid ki taraf chal kar jana mazeed (darjaat mein bulandi ka baais) hota hai."
"283","Hazrat Amr bin Abasa (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : jab banda wuzu karta hai aur apney haath dhota hai to uskey haathon sey gunah gir jatey hain, phir jab apna chehra dhota hai to uskey chehrey sey gunah gir jatey hain. phir jab apney bazu dhota hai aur apney sar ka masah karta hai to uskey baazuon aur sar sey gunah gir jatey hain. phir jab apney paon dhota hai to uskey paon sey gunah gir jatey hain."
"284","Hazrat Abdullah bin Masood (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) sey kaha (poochha) gaya : aap ney apni ummat key jin afrad ko nahin dekha, unhein (qiyamat key din) kis tarah pahchaaneingey? aap (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : wo wuzu key nishaanaat sey panj-kaliyan, chitkabrey hongey. Imam Ibne-Maja key shagrid Abu-Hasan Qataan ney Abu Hatim key wastey sey bhi mazkura riwayat ki tarah bayan kiya."
"285","Hazrat Usman (Raziallahu anhu) key azad karda ghulam Hazrat Humran (Rahimahullah) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : mainey Hazrat Usman bin Affaan (Raziallahu anhu) ko maqame  maqaaide  par bethey dekha, (wahan) unhoney pani mangwaya kar wuzu kiya, phir farmaya : mainey Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ko isi maqam par bethey dekha tha, aap ney bhi isi tarah ka wuzu kiya tha jis tarah mainey ye wuzu kiya hai, phir farmaya tha : jo shakhs merey is wuzu jaisa wuzu kerega, uskey tamam pichhley gunah bakhsh diye jaeyngey . aur (iskey baad) Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney ye bhi farmaya : aur maghroor na ho jana. (ya tum dhoka na khana.) Imam Ibne-Maja (Rahimahullah) ney Hisham bin Ammar key wastey sey bhi mazkura riwayat ki tarah bayan kiya."
"286","Humein Muhammad bin Abdullah bin Numair ne hadith sunayi, unhone Abu Muawiyah aur apne baap se, unhone A'mash se, aur humein Ali bin Muhammad ne hadith sunayi, unhone Wakee' se, unhone Sufyan se, unhone Mansoor aur Husayn se, unhone Abu Wail se, unhone Hudhaifa (radiallahu anhu) se rivayat kiya ki unhone kaha: Rasool Allah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) jab raat ko tahajjud ke liye uthte to apne muh ko miswak se saaf karte (ya ragadte) the."
"287","Humein Abu Bakr bin Abi Shayba ne hadith sunayi, unhone Abu Usamah aur Abdullah bin Numair se, unhone Ubaydullah bin Umar se, unhone Saeed bin Abi Saeed al-Maqburi se, unhone Abu Hurairah (radiallahu anhu) se rivayat kiya ki unhone kaha: Rasool Allah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: \Agar main apni ummat par mushkil na karta to unhe har namaz ke waqt miswak karne ka hukm deta.\"""""""
"288","Hazrat Abdullah bin Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) raat ko do-do rakat namaz padhtey rehtey they, phir (har do rakat sey) farigh ho kar miswak kartey they."
"289","Hazrat abu-Umama (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : miswak kiya karo kyonkey miswak munh saaf karney wali hai aur Allah Taala ko khush karney wali hai. Jibril (Alaihissalam) jab bhi merey paas aaye, miswak ki takeed zarur ki. yahan tak key mujhey khof mehsus huwa ke mujh par aur meri ummat par wo (miswaak) farz kar di jaeygi. aur agar mujhey ummat par mashaqqat ka khof na hota to main isey un par farz kar deta. main to is qadr miswak karta hun ke mujhey khatra mehsus hota hai ke munh ka aglaa hissa chheel dalunga."
"290","Hazrat Shureh bin Hani (Rahimahullah) sey riwayat hai, unhoney Hazrat Aaysha (Raziallahu anha) sey arz kiya : mujhey ye bataaiye ke Rasool (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) jab ( bahar sey) aap key paas aatey to sab sey pehley kya kartey they? Ummul-momenin (Raziallahu anha) ney farmaya : Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) jab ghar mein tashrif latey to sab sey pehley miswak kartey they."
"291","Humein Muhammad bin Abdulaziz ne hadith sunayi, unhone Muslim bin Ibrahim se, unhone Bahr bin Kaniz se, unhone Uthman bin Saj se, unhone Saeed bin Jubair se, unhone Ali bin Abi Talib (radiallahu anhu) se rivayat kiya ki unhone kaha: \Tumhare muh Quran ke raaste hain"","" to unhe miswak se saaf (aur khushboo-daar) rakho.\"""""""
"292","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : fitrat paanch cheezen hain, ya farmaya : paanch cheezen fitrat mein sey hain : khatna, (zer naaf baalon ki safai key liye) lohey ki chiz istimal karna, nakhun taraashnaa, baghlon key baal ukhadna aur munchhein kaatnaa."
"293","Hazrat Aaysha (Raziallahu anha) sey riwayat hai, Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : das cheezen fitrat sey hain : munchhein kaatnaa, daadhi badhaanaa, miswak karna, (dorane wuzu) naak mein pani dalna, nakhun taraashnaa, ungliyon key jod dhonaa, baghlon key baal ukhaadna, zere naaf baal mundna aur pani istimal karna, yani istinja karna. (hadees key eik Raavi) Hazrat Musab (Rahimahullah) ney (hadees riwayat kartey huye) farmaya : main daswein chiz bhool gaya hun, shayad kulli karna ho."
"294","Hazrat Ammar bin Yasir (Raziallahu anhuma) sey riwayat hai, Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : ye cheezen fitrat sey hain : kulli karna , naak mein pani dalna , miswak karna , munchhein kaatna , nakhun kaatna , baghlon key baal ukhaadna, (zere naaf safai key liye) lohey ki chiz istimal karna , ungliyon key jod dhona , chheentey maarna aur khatna karna. Imam Ibne-Maja ney ye riwayat Hammad bin Salma key doosrey shagrid Affaan bin Muslim ki sanad sey bhi isi tarah bayan ki hai."
"295","Hazrat Anas bin Malik (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke unhoney farmaya : munchhein kaatney, zere naaf baal moondney, baghlon key baal ukhaadney aur nakhun kaatney key liye hamarey liye ye had muqarrar ki gaee hai ke inhein chaalis raaton sey ziyada na choden."
"296","Hazrat Zaid bin Arqam (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : ye baitul-khalaa (shetanon key) hazir honey ki jaghen hain. chunanche jab tum mein sey koi (baitul-khalaa mein) dakhil ho, to usey yun kehna chahiye : ( اللَّهُمَّ إِنِّى أَعُوذُ بِكَ مِنَ الْخُبُثِ وَالْخَبَائِثِ )''aey Allah ! main teri panah mein aata hun napak jinnon aur napak Jinniyon sey.'' Imam Ibne-Maja (Rahimahullah) ney yehi riwayat apney doosrey do ustaad Jameel bin Hasan Ataki aur Harun bin Is-haq ki sanadon sey bhi ye riwayat isi tarah Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) sey bayan ki hai."
"297","Humein Muhammad bin Humaid ne hadith sunayi, unhone Al-Hakam bin Bashir bin Salman se, unhone Khallad as-Saffar se, unhone Al-Hakam an-Nasri se, unhone Abu Ishaq se, unhone Abu Juhaifa se, unhone Ali (radiallahu anhu) se rivayat kiya ki unhone kaha: Rasool Allah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: \Jinn aur bani Adam ki sharamgahon ke darmiyaan parda ye hai ki jab koi pakhane (khalaa) mein jaaye to 'Bismillah' kahe.\"""""""
"298","Hazrat Anas bin Malik (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) jab baitul-khalaa mein dakhil hotey to kehtey they : ( أَعُوذُ بِاللہ مِنَ الْخُبُثِ وَالْخَبَائِثِ )'mein napaak jinnon aur napaak jinniyon sey Allah ki panah mein aata hun.''"
"299","Hazrat Abu-Umama (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : kisi ko is baat sey aajiz nahin hona chahiye ke baitul-khalaa mein dakhil hotey waqt yun keh ley : ( اللَّهُمَّ إِنِّي أَعُوذُ بِكَ مِنَ الرِّجْسِ النَّجِسِ الْخَبِيثِ الْمُخْبِثِ الشَّيْطَانِ الرَّجِيمِ ) ''aey Allah ! main teri panah mein aata hun gandey, paleed, napaak, gandey kaam sikhaaney waley mardud shetan sey. Abu Hatim ney ibne-Abi Maryam sey isi tarah riwayat bayan ki lekin usney apni riwayat mein (مِنَ الرِّجْسِ النَّجَسِ ) key alfaz bayan nahin kiye balke sirf (مِنَ الْخَبِيثِ الْمُخْبِثِ ) key alfaz bayan kiye hain. Abu Hatim ney ibne-Abi Maryam sey isi tarah riwayat bayan ki lekin usney apni riwayat mein (مِنَ الرِّجْسِ النَّجَسِ) key alfaz bayan nahin kiye balke sirf (مِنَ الْخَبِيثِ"
"300","Humein Abu Bakr bin Abi Shayba ne hadith sunayi, unhone Yahya bin Abi Bukair se, unhone Isra'eel se, unhone Yusuf bin Abi Burda se, unhone apne baap se rivayat kiya ki unhone kaha: Main Aisha (radiallahu anha) ke paas gaya aur unhe yun kehte suna: Rasool Allah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) jab pakhane (hajat) se nikalte to kehte: 'Ghufranaka' (Ai Allah teri maghfirat chahta hoon).\nAbu al-Hasan bin Salama kahte hain: humein Abu Hatim ne khabar di, unhone Abu Ghassan an-Nahdi se, unhone Isra'eel se isi tarah rivayat kiya."
"301","Hazrat Anas bin Malik (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) jab baitul-khalaa sey bahar tashrif latey to farmatey : ( الْحَمْدُ لِلَّهِ الَّذِى أَذْهَبَ عَنِّى الأَذَى وَعَافَانِى )''Allah ka shukar hai jisney mujh sey najasat (ya takleef deh chiz) ko door kar diya aur mujhey aafiyat bakhshi.''"
"302","Humein Suwaid bin Saeed ne hadith sunayi, unhone Yahya bin Zakariya bin Abi Za'ida se, unhone apne baap se, unhone Khalid bin Salama se, unhone Abdullah al-Bahi se, unhone Urwa se, unhone Aisha (radiallahu anha) se rivayat kiya ki Rasool Allah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) har waqt (haalat mein) Allah ka zikr karte the."
"303","Humein Nasr bin Ali al-Jahdami ne hadith sunayi, unhone Abu Bakr al-Hanafi se, unhone Hammaam bin Yahya se, unhone Ibn Juraij se, unhone Zuhri se, unhone Anas bin Malik (radiallahu anhu) se rivayat kiya ki Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) jab pakhane (khalaa) mein jaate to apni anghoothi utaar dete (ya rakh dete)."
"304","Hazrat Abdullah bin Mughaffal (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : koi shakhs apney ghusl-khaney mein hergiz peshab na karey, kyonkey ziyada tar waswasey isi wajeh sey paida hotey hain. Janab Ali bin Muhammad Tanaafusi (Rahimahullah) farmatey hain : ye hukm aisey (kachchey) ghusl khaanon key barey mein hai jinka pani gadhey mein jama hota hai. aaj kal ye hukm nahin. chunkey ab log ghusl khaanon ki taamir mein choonaa, qalaee aur taarkol istimal kartey hain, (isliye pukhta farsh par pani nahin theharta aur aisi deewaron mein bhi jazb nahin hota) lihaza jab aadmi peshab kar key us jagah pani baha dey to koi harj nahin."
"305","Hazrat Huzefa (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) kuchh logon key kuda-karkat phainkney ki jagah pahunchey aur wahan khadey ho kar peshab kiya."
"306","Hazrat Mughira bin Shoba (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) kisi qom ki kuda-karkat phainkney ki jagah pahunchey aur khadey ho kar peshab kiya. Imam Shoba key ustaad Aasim bayan kartey hain ke Aamash is hadees ko Abu-Waeil key wastey sey Hazrat Huzefa (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat kartey hain, un sey bhool ho gaee hai. (ke asal mein ye hadees Mughira bin Shoba ki hai, Aamash ney ghalati sey Hazrat Huzefa (Raziallahu anhu) ka naam ley diya hai.) Imam Shoba kehtey hain ke mainey Mansoor sey puchha to unhoney mujhey Abu-Waeil key wastey sey Hazrat Huzefa (Raziallahu anhu) sey bayan kiya ke Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) kisi qom ki kudr-karkat phainkney ki jagah pahunchey aur khadey ho kar peshab kiya."
"307","Hazrat Aaysha (Raziallahu anha) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : jo shakhs tumhen ye baat bataey ke Allah key Rasool (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney khadey ho kar peshab kiya, uski tasdeeq na karna, mainey aap (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ko (hamesha) beth kar peshab kartey dekha hai."
"308","Hazrat umr (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney mujhey khadey ho kar peshab kartey dekha to farmaya : umr ! khadey ho kar peshab na karo. (Hazrat umr (Raziallahu anhu) ney farmaya : ) uskey baad mainey kabhi khadey ho kar peshab nahin kiya."
"309","Hazrat Jabir bin Abdullah (Raziallahu anhuma) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney khadey ho kar peshab karney sey mana farmaya hai. Imam Ibne-Maja ney apney ustaad Ahmed bin Abdur-Rehman Makhzoomi key wastey sey hadees Aaisha key barey mein Hazrat Sufiyan Sory sey riwayat kiya hai ke unhoney farmaya : is masley mein mardon ko ziyada maloomat ho sakti hain. yani Imam Sufiyan Sory ney Hazrat Aaysha (Raziallahu anha) key farman : mainey aap (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ko (hamesha) beth kar peshab kartey dekha hai. par Hazrat Huzefa (Raziallahu anhu) ki hadees (hadees : 305) ko tarjeeh di hai. Ahmed bin Abdur-Rehman Makhzoomi ney farmaya : Arbon mein khadey ho kar peshab karney ka riwaaj tha. isliye Abdur-Rehman bin Hasna ki hadees mein ye alfaz hain : (yahudiyon ney kaha) ye to beth kar peshab kartey hain jis tarah aurten peshab kiya karti hain."
"310","Humein Hisham bin Ammar ne hadith sunayi, unhone Abdul Hamid bin Habib bin Abi Al-Ishreen se, unhone Al-Awza'i se, unhone Yahya bin Abi Kathir se, unhone Abdullah bin Abi Qatada se, unhone apne baap (Abu Qatada) ne unhe khabar di ki unhone Rasool Allah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko farmate suna: \Jab tum mein se koi peshab kare to apna zakar apne daaye haath se na pakde aur na daaye haath se istinja kare.\""\nAur humein Abdurrahman bin Ibrahim ne hadith sunayi"","" unhone Al-Waleed bin Muslim se"","" unhone Al-Awza'i se isi sanad se isi tarah rivayat kiya."""""
"311","Hazrat Usman bin Affaan (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke unhoney farmaya : mainey na kabhi gaanaa gaaya, na jhoot bola, aur na uzue-khaas ko daain haath sey chhua, jab sey mainey is (haath) sey Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ki baiat ki."
"312","Humein Ya'qub bin Humaid bin Kasib ne hadith sunayi, unhone Al-Mugheera bin Abdurrahman aur Abdullah bin Raja' al-Makki se, unhone Muhammad bin Ajlan se, unhone Al-Qa'qa' bin Hakim se, unhone Abu Salih se, unhone Abu Hurairah (radiallahu anhu) se rivayat kiya ki unhone kaha: Rasool Allah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: \Jab tum mein se koi istinja kare (yani paaki kare) to apne daaye haath se na kare"","" balke baaye haath se istinja kare.\"""""""
"313","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : main tumharey liye is tarah hun jis tarah aulad key liye baap hota hai. (isliye) main tumhen (ba-zahir maamuli samajhey janey waley umoor ki bhi) taalim deta hun. jab tum qazaey-hajat (peshaab-paakhaane) key liye jao to qibley ki taraf munh na karo aur uski taraf peeth bhi na karo. aur Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney teen dheley istimal karney ka hukm diya, leed aur haddi istimal karney sey mana farmaya, aur daain haath sey istinja karney sey mana farmaya."
"314","Humein Abu Bakr bin Khallad al-Bahili ne hadith sunayi, unhone Yahya bin Saeed al-Qattan se, unhone Zuhair se, unhone Abu Ishaq se (kaha: ye Abu Ubaida ki hadith nahi hai, balke Abdurrahman bin Al-Aswad ne), unhone Al-Aswad se, unhone Abdullah bin Mas'ood (radiallahu anhu) se rivayat kiya ki Rasool Allah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) pakhane (khalaa) mein aaye, to farmaya: \Mere paas teen patthar laao.\"" Main do patthar aur ek gobar (ya keela) laaya. Aap (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne patthar liye aur gobar phenk di aur farmaya: \""Yeh najis (gandi) cheez hai.\"""""""
"315","Humein Muhammad bin as-Sabbah ne hadith sunayi, unhone Sufyan bin Uyaynah se, aur humein Ali bin Muhammad ne hadith sunayi, unhone Wakee' se, dono ne Hisham bin Urwa se rivayat kiya, unhone Abu Khuzaima se, unhone Umara bin Khuzaima se, unhone Khuzaima bin Thabit (radiallahu anhu) se rivayat kiya ki unhone kaha: Rasool Allah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: \Istinja (saaf karna) teen pattharon se hai jin mein se koi istemaal shuda (gobar) na ho.\"""""""
"316","Hazrat Salman (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke baaz mushrekin unka mazaq udaney lagey, eik mushrik ney kaha : main dekhta hun ke tumhara sathi (Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam)) tumhen sab kuchh sikhata hai yahan tak key pakhana karna bhi (sikhata hai) Hazrat Salman (Raziallahu anhu) ney farmaya : haan, aap ney hamein hukm diya hai ke hum (peshaab-paakhaane key liye)  qibley ki taraf munh na keren, aur daain haath sey istinja na keren, aur teen pattharon sey kam istimal na keren, un mein leed ya haddi shamil na ho."
"317","Hazrat Abdullah bin Haris bin Juz Zubaidi (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : sab sey pehley mainey hi Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ko farmatey huye suna : tum mein sey koi qibley ki taraf munh kar key peshab na kerey. aur sab sey pehley mainey hi logon ko ye hadees sunai."
"318","Hazrat abu-Ayyub Ansari (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney qazaey-hajat (peshaab-paakhaane) key liye janey waley ko qibley ki taraf munh karney sey mana kiya aur farmaya : mashriq ya maghrib ki taraf munh kiya karo."
"319","Hazrat Maaqil bin Abu-Ma'aqil Asadi (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai jo Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) key Sahaba hain, unhoney farmaya : Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney pakhana peshab kartey waqt dono qiblon (Kaaba aur Baitul-Maqdis) ki taraf munh karney sey hamen mana farmaya."
"320","Hazrat Abu-Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, unhoney Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) key barey mein gawahi di ke aap (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney peshab ya pakhane key waqt qibley ki taraf munh karney sey mana farmaya."
"321","Abu al-Hasan bin Salama kahte hain: humein Abu Sa'd Umair bin Mirdas ad-Downaqi ne ye hadith sunayi, unhone Abdurrahman bin Ibrahim Abu Yahya al-Basri se, unhone Ibn Lahi'a se, unhone Abu Zubair se, unhone Jabir (radiallahu anhu) se ki unhone Abu Saeed al-Khudri ko kahte suna: \Rasool Allah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mujhe mana kiya hai ke main khada ho kar paani na piyun aur na qibla ki taraf munh kar ke peshab karun.\"""""""
"322","Humein Hisham bin Ammar ne hadith sunayi, unhone Abdul Hamid bin Habib se, unhone Al-Awza'i se, unhone Yahya bin Saeed al-Ansari se, aur humein Abu Bakr bin Khallad aur Muhammad bin Yahya ne hadith sunayi, unhone Yazeed bin Harun se, unhone Yahya bin Saeed se, unhone Muhammad bin Yahya bin Habban ne unhe khabar di ki unke chacha Wasi' bin Habban ne unhe khabar di ki Abdullah bin Umar (radiallahu anhuma) ne kaha: \Log kehte hain ki jab tum pakhane (hajat) ke liye baitho to qibla ki taraf munh na karo. Ek din main apne ghar ki chhat par chadha to maine Rasool Allah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko do eenton par bitha hua dekha"","" aap Baitul Muqaddas (Quds) ki taraf munh kar ke baithe the.\"" Ye Yazeed bin Harun ki hadith hai."""""
"323","Hazrat Abdullah bin umr (Raziallahu anhuma) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : mainey Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ko baitul-khalaa mein qibley ki taraf munh kar key bethey huye dekha. (hadees ki sanad main eik Raavi)  Esa Khayyaat bayan kartey hain ke mainey Imam Shaaby sey is hadees key mutalliq daryaft kiya to unhoney farmaya : Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) ney bhi sach kaha aur Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ney bhi sach kaha. Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ki hadees ka matlab hai ke sehra (aur khuley maidan) mein qibley ki taraf munh ya peeth kar key na bethey, aur ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) ki hadees ka matlab ye hai ke baitul-khalaa key andar qibley ka khayal rakhna zaruri nahin, wahan tum jidhar chaho munh kar saktey ho. Abu Hatim ney Ubedullah bin Musa sey isi (Muhammad bin Yahya) ki jaisi riwayat bayan ki."
"324","Hazrat Aaysha (Raziallahu anha) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ki majlis mein zikr huwa ke kuchh log baitul-khalaa mein qibley ki taraf munh karna makrooh samajhtey hain. Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : mera khayal hai ke wo amali tor par bhi ijtinab kartey (bachte) hongey. meri baitul-khalaa ka rukh qibley ki taraf kar do. Abul-Hasan Al-Qattan ney kaha : Yahya bin Abdaka ney Abdul-Azeez bin Mughira sey, unhoney Khalid Hazzaa sey, unhoney Khalid bin Abi Salat sey sabiqa riwayat ki tarah bayan kiya."
"325","Hazrat Jabir (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney hamen peshab kartey waqt qibley ki taraf munh karney sey mana farmaya tha. phir mainey aap (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ko wafat sey eik saal pehley us taraf munh kartey dekha."
"326","Hazrat Esa bin Yazdaad Yamaani apney walid sey riwayat kartey hain, unhoney kaha : Allah key Rasool (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : jab koi shakhs peshab karey to uzu ko teen baar soont ley (zor sey daba kar kheenchey taake uskey andar jo qatraat hain, wo nikal jaaeyn). Abul-Hasan bin Salma ney kaha ke Ali bin Abdul-Azeez ney Abu Nuaim sey Zamaa key wastey sey isi (Muhammad bin Yahya) ki jaisi riwayat bayan ki."
"327","Hazrat Aaysha (Raziallahu anha) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) peshab key liye (bahir) tashrif ley gaey. Hazrat umr (Raziallahu anhu) pani ley kar aap key peechhey chaley to aap ney farmaya : umr ye kya hai?  unhoney kaha pani. aap ney farmaya : mujhey ye hukm nahin diya gaya ke jab bhi peshab karun, to wuzu bhi karun. agar main aisa karunga to ye (lazimi) sunnat bin jaaeygi."
"328","Abu-Saeed Hameeri sey riwayat hai, unhoney kaha : Hazrat Muaz bin Jabal (Raziallahu anhu) wo hadeesen bayan kiya kartey they jo doosrey Sahaba kiram Raziallahu anhum ney nahin suni hoti thin, aur jo hadisein dusron ney suni hoti thin Muaz (Raziallahu anhu) unhein bayan nahin kartey they. un ki bayan karda koi hadees Abdullah bin Amr (Raziallahu anhuma) ko malum hui to unhoney farmaya : Allah ki qism ! mainey Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) sey ye farman nahin suna. mumkin hai Hazrat Muaz (Raziallahu anhu) (key ye hadees bayan kerney) ki wajeh sey tum log ghalat fehmi mein mubtala ho jao. ye baat Hazrat Muaz (Raziallahu anhu) tak bhi pahunch gaee. (eik moqe par) un ki aapas mein mulaqat hui to Muaz (Raziallahu anhu) ney farmaya : aey Abdullah bin Amr ! Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ki taraf mansub kar key jhoot bolnaa munafiqat hai. jo shakhs aisi baat kerega, khud gunah gaar hoga. mainey Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) sey ye irshade Mubarak suna hai : lanat ka sabab ban'ney waley teen kamon sey ijtinab karo (bacho), yani ghaat par, saye mein aur raastey key darmiyan qazaey-hajat (peshaab-paakhaane) karney sey (parhez karo)."
"329","Hazrat Jabir bin Abdullah (Raziallahu anhuma) sey riwayat hai, Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : raastey key darmiyan (raat ko aaram karney aur soney key liye ( na thehrao , aur wahan namaz na padho kyon ye saanpon aur darindon ka thikana hai, aur wahan qazaey-hajat na karo kyonkey ye lanat ka baais hai."
"330","Humein Muhammad bin Yahya ne hadith sunayi, unhone Amr bin Khalid se, unhone Ibn Lahi'a se, unhone Qurra se, unhone Ibn Shihab se, unhone Salim se, unhone apne baap (Abdullah bin Umar) se rivayat kiya ki Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne mana kiya hai ke raaste mein namaz parhi jaye aur na wahan pakhana (khalaa) kiya jaye aur na wahan peshab kiya jaye."
"331","Humein Abu Bakr bin Abi Shayba ne hadith sunayi, unhone Ismail bin Ulayya se, unhone Muhammad bin Amr se, unhone Abu Salama se, unhone Al-Mugheera bin Shu'ba (radiallahu anhu) se rivayat kiya ki unhone kaha: Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) jab pakhane (hajat ke liye) jaate to door (kisi jagah) chale jaate."
"332","Hazrat Anas (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : main eik safar mein Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) key sath tha. aap qazaey-hajat key liye door tashrif ley gaey, phir wapis aa kar wuzu key liye pani talab farmaya aur wuzu kya."
"333","Humein Ya'qub bin Humaid bin Kasib ne hadith sunayi, unhone Yahya bin Sulaim se, unhone Ibn Khuthaim se, unhone Yunus bin Khabbab se, unhone Ya'la bin Murra (radiallahu anhu) se rivayat kiya ki Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) jab pakhane (ghaait ke liye) jaate to door chale jaate."
"334","Abu Bakr bin Abi Shayba aur Muhammad bin Bashar ne kaha: humein Yahya bin Saeed al-Qattan ne hadees sunayi, Abu Jafar al-Khatmi se (Abu Bakr bin Abi Shayba ne kaha: uska naam Umair bin Yazid hai), wo Umara bin Khuzaima aur Haris bin Fuzail se, wo Abdur Rahman bin Abi Qurad se, unhone kaha: maine Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke saath hajj kiya, to aap apni hajat ke liye gaye aur door gaye."
"335","Hazrat Jabir (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : hum log Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) key sath eik safar mein rawana huye .) safar key doran mein) Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) us waqt tak qazaey-hajat nahin kartey they jab tak ke nazron sey ojhal na ho jatey aur kisi ko nazar na aatey ."
"336","Abbas bin Abdul Azim al-Anbari ne kaha: humein Abdullah bin Kasir bin Jafar ne hadees sunayi, humein Kasir bin Abdullah al-Muzani ne hadees sunayi, apne walid se, wo apne dada se, wo Bilal bin Haris al-Muzani se, ke Rasool Allah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) jab hajat karna chahte to door jaate."
"337","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : jo dheley istimal karey wo taaq tadaad mein istimal kerey. jisney aisa kya to achcha kya. jisney na kya to koi harj nahin . jisney ( daanton mein) Khilal istimal kya to ( khaney key jo zarrey waghera niklen unhein) phenk dey aur jo kuch zaban key zariey sey (daanton key darmiyan sey) nikal aaye usey nigal ley. jisney is tarah kya to achcha kya, jisney na kya to koi harj nahin . jo shakhs qazaey-hajat key liye jaey usey chahiye ke parda kerey. agar ret ki dheri key siwa koi ot na miley to (mazeed ret jama kar key) is mein izafa kar ley (taake munasib had tak pardey key qabil ho jaey) kyonkey shetan insan ki peeth sey chhed chhaad karta hai. jisney aisa kya to achcha kya. jisney na kya to koi harj nahin ."
"338","usi hadees ki eik riwayat mein ye izafa hai : jo surma lagaey to taaq tadaad mein lagaey . jisney aisa kya to achcha kya. jisney na kya to koi harj nahin . aur jo shakhs zaban key zariey sey (daanton key darmiyan sey) kuch nikaley to usey chahiye ke nigal ley ."
"339","Hazrat Yala bin Murra (Raziallahu anhuma) apney walid (Murra bin Wahab saqafii) sey riwayat kartey hain, unhoney farmaya : main eik safar mein Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) key sath tha. aap ney qazaey-hajat ka irada kya to mujh sey farmaya : khajoor key un do chhotey paudon key paas ja kar unhein kaho : Allah key Rasool tumhen hukm detey hain ke aapas mein mil jao . chunanche wo mil gaey . aap (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney unkey zariey sey parda farma kar hajat puri ki, phir mujh sey farmaya : unkey paas ja kar kaho : tum mein sey har pauda apni apni jagah wapis chala jaey . mainey unhein kaha to wo apni apni jagah wapis chaley gaey ."
"340","Muhammad bin Yahya ne kaha: humein Abu al-Numan ne hadees sunayi, humein Mahdi bin Maimun ne hadees sunayi, humein Muhammad bin Abi Yaqub ne hadees sunayi, Hasan bin Sad se, wo Abdullah bin Jafar se, unhone kaha: Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) apni hajat ke liye sabse zyada pasand karte the ki parda karein ek nishaan ya khajoor ke jhund se."
"341","Hazrat Abdullah bin Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) raastey sey hat kar ghaati ki taraf chaley gaey aur (wahan ja kar) peshab kya. jab aap ney peshab kya to main aap key qarib (munh dusri taraf kar key khada) tha taake aap ki pusht zahir na ho."
"342","Hazrat abu-Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : qazaey-hajat kartey waqt do aadmi baaten na karen ke har eik ki nazar apney sathi key pardey key aaza par pad rahi ho. Allah Taala us (ghalat kaam) sey sakht naraz hota hai.' Muhammad bin Yahya (mazkoora riwayat jab) ikrima bin Ammar key (doosrey) shagrid Silm bin Ibrahim al-Warraq sey bayan kartey hain to Raavi ka naam (Hilal bin Ayaaz ki bajaey) Ayaaz bin Hilal bayan kartey hain, aur kehtey hain ke yehi durust aur sahih hai. Muhammad bin Humed (mazkoora riwayat jab) ikrima bin Ammar key (teesrey) shagrid Sufiyan Sory sey bayan kartey hain to Raavi ka naam ( Hilal bin ayaaz aur ayaaz bin Hilal ki bajaey) ayaaz bin Abdullah bayan kartey hain."
"343","Muhammad bin Rumh ne kaha: humein Laith bin Sad ne khabar di, Abu Zubair se, wo Jabir se, wo Rasool Allah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, ke aap ne mana farmaya thehre hue paani mein peshab karne se."
"344","Abu Bakr bin Abi Shayba ne kaha: humein Abu Khalid al-Ahmar ne hadees sunayi, Ibn Ajlan se, unke walid se, wo Abu Huraira se, unhone kaha: Rasool Allah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: \Tum mein se koi bhi thehre hue paani mein hargiz peshab na kare.\"""""""
"345","Muhammad bin Yahya ne kaha: humein Muhammad bin Mubarak ne hadees sunayi, humein Yahya bin Hamza ne hadees sunayi, humein Ibn Abi Farwa ne hadees sunayi, Nafe se, wo Ibn Umar se, unhone kaha: Rasool Allah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: \Tum mein se koi bhi jamay hue paani mein hargiz peshab na kare.\"""""""
"346","Hazrat Abdur-Rehman bin Hasna (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai unhoney farmaya : Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ( ghar sey) bahar hamarey paas tashrif laye aur aap key haath main eik dhaal thi.) aap (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ko peshab ki hajat mehsus hui to (usey) zamin par rakha aur uski taraf rukh kar key beth kar peshab kya. kisi ney kaha : un sahab ko dekho is tarah peshab kartey hain jis tarah aurat kya karti hai. Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney uski baat sun li . chunanche farmaya : tujh par afsos ! kya tujhey malum nahin ke Bani-Israel key us aadmi key sath kya huwa? un logon ko jab ( kapdey waghera ko) peshab lag jata to qenchiyon sey kaat diya kartey they (kyonkey un ki shariyat mein yehi hukm tha) usney unhein us sey mana kar diya to usey qabr mein azab diya gaya. Imam Ibne-Maja ney Aamash key doosrey shagrid Ubedullah bin Musa sey usi (abu-Muaawia) ki misl riwayat bayan ki."
"347","Hazrat Abdullah bin Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) do naee qabron key paas sey guzrey to farmaya : un dono ( aadmiyon) ko azab ho raha hai aur kisi badi wajeh sey azab nahin ho raha . un mein sey eik to apney peshab sey nahin bachta tha aur doosra chughal-khori ka aadi tha."
"348","Abu Bakr bin Abi Shayba ne kaha: humein Affan ne hadees sunayi, humein Abu Awanah ne hadees sunayi, Aamash se, wo Abu Salih se, wo Abu Huraira se, unhone kaha: Rasool Allah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: \Qabar ka azeem azab peshab se hai.\"""""""
"349","Hazrat abu-Bakra (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) do qabron key paas sey guzrey to farmaya : un do shakhson ko azab ho raha hai. aur azab bhi kisi badey kaam ki wajeh sey nahin ho raha . eik ko to peshab ki wajeh sey azab ho raha hai aur doosrey ko gheebat ki saza mil rahi hai.'"
"350","Ismail bin Muhammad al-Talhi aur Ahmad bin Saeed al-Darimi ne kaha: humein Rooh bin Ubadah ne hadees sunayi, Saeed se, wo Qatada se, wo Hasan se, wo Huzain bin Mundhir bin Haris bin Walah Abu Sasan al-Raqashi se, wo Muhajir bin Qunfuz bin Umair bin Judan se, unhone kaha: main Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aaya jab aap wuzu kar rahe the, to maine aap ko salam kiya, to aap ne mujhe salam ka jawab nahi diya. Phir jab aap wuzu se farigh hue to farmaya: \Mujhe salam ka jawab dene se iske siwa kisi cheez ne nahi roka ke main baghair wuzu tha.\"" Abu al-Hasan bin Salama ne kaha: humein Abu Hatim ne hadees sunayi"","" humein Ansari ne hadees sunayi"","" Saeed bin Abi Arubah se"","" phir aise hi zikr kiya."""""
"351","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) peshab kar rahey they ke eik aadmi paas sey guzraa, usney aap (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) par salam kya. Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney jawab na diya. jab aap farigh huye to zamin par dono haath maar kar tayammum kya, phir uskey salam ka jawab diya."
"352","Hazrat Jabir bin Abdullah (Raziallahu anhuma) sey riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) peshab kar rahey they ke eik aadmi paas sey guzra to usney salam kaha . Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney us sey farmaya : jab tum mujhey us haalat mein dekho to salam na kaha karo . agar tum aisa karogey to main tumhen jawab nahin dunga."
"353","Abdullah bin Saeed aur Husain bin Abi al-Sari al-Asqalani ne kaha: humein Abu Dawood ne hadees sunayi, Sufyan se, wo Dahhak bin Usman se, wo Nafe se, wo Ibn Umar se, unhone kaha: ek aadmi Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas se guzra jab aap peshab kar rahe the, to usne aap ko salam kiya, to aap ne us ko jawab nahi diya."
"354","Hazrat Aaysha (Raziallahu anha) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : mainey nahin dekha ke Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) kabhi baitul-khala sey tashrif laye hon aur pani istimal na kya ho."
"355","Hazrat abu-Ayyub Ansari, Hazrat Jabir bin Abdullah aur Hazrat Anas bin Malik Raziallahu anhum sey riwayat hai ke jab ye aayat nazil hui : ( فِيهِ رِجَالٌ يُحِبُّونَ أَنْ يَتَطَهَّرُوا وَاللَّهُ يُحِبُّ الْمُطَّهِّرِينَ )' us masjid mein aisey aadmi ( namaz padhtey) hain jo pak rehna pasand kartey hain aur Allah bhi pak rehney walon ko pasand farmata hai. to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : aey ansaar ki jamaat! Allah Taala ney tumhari safai pasandi ki tareef ki hai. tumhari safai kaisi hoti hai? unhoney arz kya : hum namaz key liye wuzu kartey hain, janabat sey ghusl kartey hain aur pani sey istinja kartey hain. aap (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : yehi baat hai. us ko ikhtiyar kiye rakhna ."
"356","Hazrat Aaysha (Raziallahu anha) sey riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) (istinja kartey waqt) pusht teen baar dhotey they. Hazrat Abdullah bin umr (Raziallahu anhuma) ney farmaya : hamney us amal ko ikhtiyar kya to usey ilaj bhi paya aur pakizgi ka baais bhi. abul-Hasan bin Salma Qataan ney apni sanad sey bhi mazkura riwayat ki tarah bayan kya hai."
"357","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : aayat mubaraka ( فِيْهِ رِجَالٌ يُّحِبُّوْنَ اَنْ يَّتَطَهَّرُوْا padhi. وَاللّٰهُ يُحِبُّ الْمُطَّهِّرِيْنَ )' us masjid mein aisey aadmi ( namaz padhtey ( hain jo pak rehna pasand kartey hain, aur Allah bhi pak rehney walon ko pasand farmata hai. qubaa walon key barey mein nazil hui hai. farmaya : wo pani sey istinja kartey they, to unkey barey mein ye aayat nazil hui ."
"358","Abu Bakr bin Abi Shayba aur Ali bin Muhammad ne kaha: humein Wakee ne hadees sunayi, Shareek se, wo Ibrahim bin Jarir se, wo Abu Zur'ah bin Amr bin Jarir se, wo Abu Huraira se, ke Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne hajat se farigh hue, phir ek bartan se istinja kiya, phir apna haath zameen par ragarha. Abu al-Hasan bin Salama ne kaha: humein Abu Hatim ne hadees sunayi, humein Saeed bin Sulaiman al-Wasiti ne hadees sunayi, Shareek se, isi tarah."
"359","Hazrat Jareer bin Abdullah bijli (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Allah key Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) darakhton key eik jhund mein dakhil huye aur qazaey-hajat ki. Hazrat Jareer (Raziallahu anhu) ney pani ka bartan hazir kya, chunanche aap ney us sey istinja farmaya aur haath ko mitti sey ragda."
"360","Hazrat Jabir (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney hamein hukm diya hai ke hum apney mishkeezon ka munh baandh diya karen aur bartanon ko dhank diya karen."
"361","Isma bin Fazl aur Yahya bin Hakim ne kaha: humein Harami bin Umara bin Abi Hafsah ne hadees sunayi, humein Harish bin Khirrit ne hadees sunayi, humein Ibn Abi Mulaikah ne khabar di, Aisha se, unhone kaha: main Rasool Allah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke liye raat ko teen bartan rakhti thi jo dhake hue hote the: ek bartan aap ke tuhar ke liye, ek bartan aap ke miswak ke liye, aur ek bartan aap ke peene ke liye."
"362","Abu Badr Abbad bin Walid ne kaha: humein Mutahhar bin Haitham ne hadees sunayi, humein Alqamah bin Abi Jamrah al-Dubai ne hadees sunayi, apne walid Abu Jamrah al-Dubai se, wo Ibn Abbas se, unhone kaha: Rasool Allah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) apna tuhar kisi ko nahi saunpte the aur na hi apni us sadaqah ko jo wo dete the; wo khud hi us ka intezam karte the."
"363","Janab abu-Rizeen (Rahimahullah) sey riwayat hai, unhoney kaha : mainey Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ko dekha ke unhoney peshani par haath maara aur kaha : aey Iraaq walo ! tumhara ye khayal hai ke main Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) par jhoot bol raha hun? (uska nateeja ye hoga) ke tumhen faeyda hasil ho jaey aur mujhey gunah ho. main gawahi deta hun ke mainey Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ko ye farmatey suna hai : jab tum mein sey kisi key bartan mein kutaa munh dal dey to usey chahiye ke us (bartan) ko saat baar dhoey."
"364","Muhammad bin Yahya ne kaha: humein Rooh bin Ubadah ne hadees sunayi, humein Malik bin Anas ne hadees sunayi, Abu al-Zinad se, wo Aaraj se, wo Abu Huraira se, ke Rasool Allah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: \Jab kutta tum mein se kisi ke bartan mein pe le"","" to use saat baar dho le.\"""""""
"365","Abu Bakr bin Abi Shayba ne kaha: humein Shababah ne hadees sunayi, humein Shubah ne hadees sunayi, Abu al-Tayyah se, unhone kaha: maine Mutarrif ko hadees bayan karte hue suna Abdullah bin Mughaffal se, ke Rasool Allah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: \Jab kutta bartan mein apna moonh daal kar pe le"","" to use saat baar dho aur aathween baar mitti se ragad do.\"""""""
"366","Hazrat Abdullah bin umr (Raziallahu anhuma) sey riwayat hai, Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : jab tum mein sey kisi key bartan mein kutta pi ley to usey chahiye ke us (bartan) ko saat baar dhoey."
"367","Hazrat Kabsha binte Kaabi (Raziallahu anha) jo Hazrat abu-Qatada (Raziallahu anhu) key eik betey ki biwi thin, un sey riwayat hai ke unhoney Hazrat abu-Qatada (Raziallahu anhu) key liye bartan mein pani dal kar rakha taake wo wuzu kar lein. (itney mein) eik billi aa kar (us sey pani) peeney lagi. Hazrat abu-Qatada (Raziallahu anhu) ney bartan jhuka diya (taake wo aasani sey pani pi ley), (Hazrat Kabsha (Raziallahu anha) ney farmaya)  main un ki taraf (tajjub sey) dekhney lagi to unhoney farmaya : meri bhatiji ! kya tumhen tajjub ho raha hai? Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : ye naapak nahin. ye to (har waqt gharon mein) aati jaati rehti hai."
"368","Amr bin Rafi aur Ismail bin Tawbah ne kaha: humein Yahya bin Zakariyya bin Abi Zaidah ne hadees sunayi, Harithah se, wo Amrah se, wo Aisha se, unhone kaha: main aur Rasool Allah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ek hi bartan se wuzu karte the jis mein us se pehle billi ne peeya tha."
"369","Muhammad bin Bashar ne kaha: humein Ubaidullah bin Abd al-Majid ne hadees sunayi, humein Abdur Rahman bin Abi al-Zinad ne hadees sunayi, apne walid se, wo Abu Salamah se, wo Abu Huraira se, unhone kaha: Rasool Allah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: \Billi namaz nahi todti kyunki wo ghar ke samaan mein se hai.\"""""""
"370","Hazrat Abdullah bin Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) sey riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ki eik zauja (biwi) mohtarma (Raziallahu anha) ney eik tab mein (pani ley kar) ghusl kiya. uskey baad Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ghusl ya wuzu karney key liye tashrif laye to unhoney arz kiya : aey Allah key Rasool ! main junbi (samhog ke baad ki napaak) thi. to (aap (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya :) ,pani napaak nahin hota."
"371","Hazrat ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) sey riwayat hai ke paak biwiyon Raziallahu anhu mein sey kisi zauja mohtarma ney ghusle-janabat (samhog ke bad ka ghusl) kiya. unkey wuzu sey bachey huye pani sey Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney wuzu aur ghusl farma liya."
"372","Muhammad bin Muthanna, Muhammad bin Yahya aur Ishaq bin Mansoor ne kaha: humein Abu Dawood ne hadees sunayi, humein Shareek ne hadees sunayi, Simak se, wo Ikrimah se, wo Ibn Abbas se, wo Maimunah se jo Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki biwi hain, ke Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne unke ghusl janabat ke bache hue paani se wuzu kiya."
"373","Muhammad bin Bashar ne kaha: humein Abu Dawood ne hadees sunayi, humein Shubah ne hadees sunayi, Asim al-Ahwal se, wo Abu Hajib se, wo Hakam bin Amr se, ke Rasool Allah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne aadmi ko aurat ke wuzu ke bache hue paani se wuzu karne se mana farmaya."
"374","Hazrat Abdullah bin Sarjis (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney is baat sey mana farmaya hai ke aurat key wuzu sey bachey huye pani sey aadmi ghusl karey, ya mard key bachey huye pani sey aurat ghusl kerey. balke (ye hukm diya ke) dono ikhatta shuru kar den. Abu-Adbullah Ibne-Maja (muallif (lekhak) Sunan Ibne-Maja) ney kaha : sahih pehli baat hai. dusri weham hai. Abul-Hasan bin Salma ney kaha, hamein Abu Hatim aur Abu-Usman Mahaaribi ney bayan kiya, un dono ney kaha ke hamein Mualla bin Asad ney saabiq riwayat ki tarah bayan kiya."
"375","Hazrat Ali (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) aur aap ki zauja (biwi) eik hi bartan sey (pani ley ley kar) ghusl kar liya kartey they lekin eik doosrey key bachey huye pani sey ghusl nahin kartey they."
"376","Muhammad bin Rumh ne kaha: humein Laith bin Sad ne khabar di, Ibn Shihab se, aur (doosri sanad) Abu Bakr bin Abi Shayba ne kaha: humein Sufyan bin Uyainah ne hadees sunayi, Zuhri se, wo Urwah se, wo Aisha se, unhone kaha: main aur Rasool Allah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ek hi bartan se ghusl karte the."
"377","Abu Bakr bin Abi Shayba ne kaha: humein Sufyan bin Uyainah ne hadees sunayi, Amr bin Dinar se, wo Jabir bin Zaid se, wo Ibn Abbas se, wo unki khala Maimunah se, unhone kaha: main aur Rasool Allah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ek hi bartan se ghusl karte the."
"378","Haddasana Abu Aamir al-Ash'ari Abdullah bin Aamir, haddasana Yahya bin Abi Bukair, haddasana Ibrahim bin Nafi', an Ibn Abi Najeeh, an Mujahid, an Umm Hani, ke Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne ghusl kiya aur Maimoona (radi Allahu anha) bhi, ek hi bartan se, ek qas'ah mein jis mein aate ke nishaan the."
"379","Haddasana Abu Bakr bin Abi Shaybah, haddasana Muhammad bin al-Hasan al-Asadi, haddasana Shareek, an Abdullah bin Muhammad bin Aqeel, an Jabir bin Abdullah (radi Allahu anhuma), unhonne kaha: Rasool Allah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) aur unki biwiyan ek hi bartan se ghusl karte the."
"380","Haddasana Abu Bakr bin Abi Shaybah, haddasana Ismail bin Ulayyah, an Hisham al-Dastawa'i, an Yahya bin Abi Katheer, an Abi Salamah, an Zainab bint Umm Salamah, an Umm Salamah (radi Allahu anha), ke woh aur Rasool Allah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ek hi bartan se ghusl karte the."
"381","Hazrat Abdullah bin umr (Raziallahu anhuma) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) key zamaney mein mard aur aurten eik hi bartan mein sey wuzu kar liya kartey they."
"382","Hazrat Umme Sabiya Zuhaina (Raziallahu anha) sey riwayat hai ke eik hi bartan mein sey wuzu kartey huye baaz oqaat mera haath aur Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ka haath eik sath (bartan mein) padta. Imam abu-Adbullah Ibne-Maja ney farmaya : mainey Muhammad (bin Yahyaa Zahli) sey suna, wo kehtey they, Umme Sabiya, Khaula binte Qais hai. ye baat mainey Abu-Zara'a sey zikr ki to unhoney kaha, Muhammad ney sach kaha."
"383","Haddasana Muhammad bin Yahya, haddasana Dawood bin Shabeeb, haddasana Habeeb bin Abi Habeeb, an Amr bin Haram, an Ikrimah, an Aisha (radi Allahu anha), an-Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se, ke woh dono (Aisha aur Nabi) namaz ke liye ek saath wuzu karte the."
"384","Hazrat Abdullah bin Masood (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney jinnon sey mulaqat wali raat un sey farmaya : kya tumharey paas wuzu ka pani hai? mainey arz kiya : ji nahin, bas chamdey key bartan mein thodi si nabeez hai. aap (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : paak khajuren hain aur paak karney wala pani hai.  phir Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney (usi pani sey) wuzu kar liya. ye riwayat Wakee ki hai."
"385","Hazrat Abdullah bin Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) sey riwayat hai ke jinnon wali raat Allah key Rasool (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney Hazrat Abdullah bin Masood (Raziallahu anhu) sey farmaya : kya tumharey paas pani hai? unhoney kaha : nahin . lekin mishkize mein nabeez mojud hai. Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : paak khajuren hain aur paak karney wala pani hai, mujh par dalo. mainey (nabeez ko) Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) key haathon par undelaa aur aap (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney uskey sath wuzu kiya."
"386","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : eik aadmi Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir huwa aur kaha : aey Allah key Rasool ! hum samandar ka safar kartey hain aur apney sath thoda sa pani ley letey hain. agar hum us sey wuzu kar lein to piyasey reh jaeyngey. (peeney key liye pani nahin rahega) to kya hum samandar key pani sey wuzu kar liya keren? Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : uska pani paak karney wala aur uska mara huwa janwer halal hai."
"387","Hazrat ibne Farasi (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, unhoney kaha : main shikar kiya karta tha aur merey paas eik mashk thi, main is mein pani dal liya karta tha. mainey samandar key pani sey wuzu kiya, phir Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) sey ye waqia bayan kiya to aap (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : uska pani pak karney wala hai aur uska mara huwa janwer halal hai."
"388","Haddasana Muhammad bin Yahya, haddasana Ahmad bin Hanbal, haddasana Abul Qasim bin Abi al-Zinad, unhonne kaha: haddasani Ishaq bin Hazim, an Ubaydullah – woh Ibn Miqsam hain – an Jabir (radi Allahu anhu), ke Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se samandar ke paani ke baare mein poocha gaya, to aapne farmaya: \Woh paak hai"","" uska paani paak aur uski murda halal hai.\"" Abul Hasan bin Salamah ne kaha: haddasana Ali bin al-Hasan al-Hisinjani"","" haddasana Ahmad bin Hanbal"","" haddasana Abul Qasim bin Abi al-Zinad"","" haddasani Ishaq bin Hazim"","" an Ubaydullah – woh Ibn Miqsam hain – an Jabir bin Abdullah (radi Allahu anhuma)"","" ke Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne – phir aisi hi hadith bayan ki."""""
"389","Hazrat Mughira bin Shoba (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) kisi kaam sey tashrif ley gaey. jab aap wapis aaye to main pani ka bartan ley kar hazir huwa. mainey pani dala to Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney dono haath dhoey, phir Chehra Mubarak dhoya , phir apney bazu dhoney ka irada kiya to jubba ki aasteenein tang malum huin, chunanche aap ney jubba key nichey sey bazu nikal liye aur unhein dhoya aur mozon par masah kiya, phir hamein namaz padhaai."
"390","Hazrat Rabee binte Muawwiz (Raziallahu anha) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : main wuzu ka bartan ley kar Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir hui. aap ney farmaya : pani dalo. mainey pani dala to aap ney apna Chehra Mubarak aur dono bazu dhoey. phir naya pani liya aur uskey sath sar key agley aur pichley hissey ka masah kiya aur apney paon ko teen teen baar dhoya."
"391","Haddasana Bishr bin Aadam, haddasana Zaid bin al-Hubab, haddasani al-Waleed bin Uqbah, haddasani Huzayfah bin Abi Huzayfah al-Azdi, an Safwan bin Assal, unhonne kaha: Maine Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) par safar aur hazar mein wuzu ke liye paani bahaya."
"392","Kurduus ibn Abi ‘Abdillaah al-Waasitiyy narrated to us, ‘Abdul-Kariim ibn Rawh narrated to us, my father Rawh ibn ‘Anbasah ibn Sa‘idd ibn Abi ‘Ayyaash, the freed slave of ‘Uthmaan ibn ‘Affaan, narrated to me, from his father ‘Anbasah ibn Sa‘idd, from his grandmother Umm Abihaa Umm ‘Ayyaash, who had been a slave girl of Ruqayyah bint Rasoolillaah (peace be upon him), she said: “I used to perform wudoo’ for the Messenger of Allah (peace be upon him) while I was standing and he was sitting.”"
"393","Haddasana Abdur Rahman bin Ibrahim al-Dimashqi, haddasana al-Waleed bin Muslim, haddasana al-Awza'i, haddasani al-Zuhri, an Saeed bin al-Musayyab aur Abi Salamah bin Abdur Rahman, ke un donon ne unhe hadith sunayi ke Abu Hurairah (radi Allahu anhu) kehte the: Rasool Allah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: \Jab tum mein se koi raat ko jaage"","" to apna haath bartan mein na daale jab tak ke us par do ya teen baar paani na baha de"","" kyunki tum nahi jaante ke raat ko uska haath kahan tha.\"""""""
"394","Haddasana Harmalah bin Yahya, haddasana Abdullah bin Wahab, akhbarani Ibn Lahi'ah aur Jabir bin Ismail, an Uqayl, an Ibn Shihab, an Salim, an apne walid (Abdullah bin Umar) se, unhonne kaha: Rasool Allah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: \Jab tum mein se koi apni neend se jaage"","" to apna haath bartan mein na daale jab tak use dho na le.\"""""""
"395","Hazrat Jabir (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : jab koi neend sey bedaar ho kar wuzu karna chahey to wuzu key pani mein haath na daley jab tak usey dho na ley kyonkey usey malum nahin ke raat ko uska haath kahan raha hai aur na ye malum hai ke usney kis chiz par haath rakha hai.  Abu-Is'haq ney kaha, sahih sanad Jabir an Abi Huraira hai."
"396","Hazrat Haris sey riwayat hai ke Hazrat Ali (Raziallahu anhu) ney pani mangwaya , phir pani mein haath dalney sey pehley haath dhoey , phir farmaya : mainey Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ko isi tarah kartey dekha hai."
"397","Haddasana Abu Kuraib Muhammad bin al-Ala, haddasana Zaid bin al-Hubab, aur (doosri sanad) haddasana Muhammad bin Bashar, haddasana Abu Aamir al-Aqadi, aur (teesri sanad) haddasana Ahmad bin Manee', haddasana Abu Ahmad al-Zubairi, unhonne kaha: haddasana Katheer bin Zaid, an Rubayh bin Abdur Rahman bin Abi Saeed, an apne walid, an Abu Saeed (radi Allahu anhu), ke Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: \Wuzu nahi hai us ke liye jis ne us par Allah ka naam na liya.\"""""""
"398","Haddasana al-Hasan bin Ali al-Khallal, haddasana Yazeed bin Haroon, anba'ana Yazeed bin Iyad, haddasana Abu Thifal, an Rabah bin Abdur Rahman bin Abi Sufyan, ke usne apni daadi ko suna, jo bint Saeed bin Zaid theen, woh bayan karti theen ke unhone apne walid Saeed bin Zaid ko kehte suna: Rasool Allah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: \Namaz nahi hai us ke liye jis ke wuzu nahi"","" aur wuzu nahi hai us ke liye jis ne Allah ka naam na liya.\"""""""
"399","Haddasana Abu Kuraib aur Abdur Rahman bin Ibrahim, unhonne kaha: haddasana Ibn Abi Fudayk, haddasana Muhammad bin Musa bin Abi Abdullah, an Yaqub bin Salamah al-Laysi, an apne walid, an Abu Hurairah (radi Allahu anhu), unhonne kaha: Rasool Allah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: \Namaz nahi hai us ke liye jis ke wuzu nahi"","" aur wuzu nahi hai us ke liye jis ne Allah ka naam na liya.\"""""""
"400","Hazrat Sehal bin Saad Saaidi (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya is shakhs ki namaz nahin jis ka wuzu nahin aur uska wuzu nahin jisney (wuzu kartey waqt) Allah ka naam na liya ho aur uski namaz nahin jo Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) par durood nahin padhta. aur jo Ansaar sey mohabbat nahin rakhta uski bhi namaz nahin.(Imam Ibne-Maja (Rahimahullah) key shagrid) Abul-Hasan bin Salma ney Abdul Muhemin bin Abbas key doosrey shagrid Abees bin Marhoom Attaar sey isi tarah riwayat bayan ki."
"401","Haddasana Hannad bin al-Sari, haddasana Abul Ahwas, an Ash'ath bin Abi al-Sha'tha, aur (doosri sanad) haddasana Sufyan bin Wakee', haddasana Umar bin Ubayd al-Tanafisi, an Ash'ath bin Abi al-Sha'tha, an apne walid, an Masrooq, an Aisha (radi Allahu anha), ke Rasool Allah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko tayammun pasand tha (yani daayein taraf se shuru karna) taharat mein jab woh taharat karte, aur baal sanwarne mein jab woh baal sanwarte, aur joota pehnne mein jab woh joota pehente."
"402","Haddasana Muhammad bin Yahya, haddasana Abu Ja'far al-Nufayli, haddasana Zuhayr bin Muawiyah, an al-A'mash, an Abi Salih, an Abu Hurairah (radi Allahu anhu), unhonne kaha: Rasool Allah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: \Jab tum wuzu karo to apne daayein hisson se shuru karo.\"" Abul Hasan bin Salamah ne kaha: haddasana Abu Hatim"","" haddasana Yahya bin Salih aur Ibn Nufayl aur ghair unhon ne kaha: haddasana Zuhayr"","" phir aisi hi hadith bayan ki."""""
"403","Haddasana Abdullah bin al-Jarrah aur Abu Bakr bin Khallad al-Bahili, unhonne kaha: haddasana Abdul Aziz bin Muhammad, an Zaid bin Aslam, an Ata bin Yasar, an Ibn Abbas (radi Allahu anhuma), ke Rasool Allah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne ek hi chirru se kulla kiya aur naak mein paani daala."
"404","Haddasana Abu Bakr bin Abi Shaybah, haddasana Shareek, an Khalid bin Alqamah, an Abd Khair, an Ali (radi Allahu anhu), ke Rasool Allah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne wuzu kiya to teen baar kulla kiya aur teen baar naak mein paani daala, ek hi haath se."
"405","Hazrat Abdullah bin Zaid Ansari (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) hamarey paas tashrif laye aur wuzu key liye pani talab farmaya : mainey pani hazir kya to aap (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney eik chullu sey kulli ki aur naak mein pani dala ."
"406","Haddasana Ahmad bin Abadah, haddasana Hammad bin Zaid, an Mansoor, aur (doosri sanad) haddasana Abu Bakr bin Abi Shaybah, haddasana Abul Ahwas, an Mansoor, an Hilal bin Yasaf, an Salamah bin Qays, unhonne kaha: Mujhse Rasool Allah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: \Jab wuzu karo to naak jhaarko"","" aur jab istinja karo to taaq (taaq adad) rakho.\"""""""
"407","Hazrat laqeet bin Sabra (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : mainey arz kya : aey Allah key Rasool ! mujhey wuzu key barey mein irshad farmaiye . aap (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : wuzu achi tarah pura kar, aur naak mein pani dalney mein mubaalgha kar, siwaye uskey ke to rozey sey ho."
"408","Haddasana Abu Bakr bin Abi Shaybah, haddasana Ishaq bin Sulayman, aur (doosri sanad) haddasana Ali bin Muhammad, haddasana Wakee', an Ibn Abi Dhi'b, an Qariz bin Shaybah, an Abi Ghatafan al-Murri, an Ibn Abbas (radi Allahu anhuma), unhonne kaha: Rasool Allah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: \Naak jhaarko do baar"","" pooree tarah se"","" ya teen baar.\"""""""
"409","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : jo shakhs wuzu karey , usey chahiye ke naak jhaadey , aur jo (istinja key liye) dheley istimal kerey. usey chahiye ke taaq tadaad mein istimal kerey."
"410","Hazrat Sabit bin Abi Safiya Samaali sey riwayat hai, unhoney kaha ke mainey Abu-Jafar sey puchha : kya aap ko Hazrat Jabir bin Abdullah (Raziallahu anhuma) sey marvi ye hadees pahunchi hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney eik eik baar (ang dho kar) wuzu kiya? unhoney farmaya : haan, mainey kaha : aur (ye hadees bhi ke) do do baar aur teen teen baar (aaza dho kar wuzu kiya?) unhoney farmaya : haan."
"411","Haddasana Abu Bakr bin Khallad al-Bahili, haddasana Yahya bin Saeed al-Qattan, an Sufyan, an Zaid bin Aslam, an Ata bin Yasar, an Ibn Abbas (radi Allahu anhuma), unhonne kaha: Maine Rasool Allah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko dekha, unhonne wuzu kiya ek ek chirru se."
"412","Hazrat umr (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : mainey tabuk ki jng key doran mein Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ko dekha ke aap ney eik eik baar (aaza dho kar) wuzu kya."
"413","Hazrat Shaqeeq bin Salma (Rahimahullah) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : mainey Hazrat Usman aur Hazrat Ali (Raziallahu anhuma) ko dekha ke wo teen-teen baar  aaza dho kar) wuzu kartey they aur farmatey they : Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ka wuzu is tarah huwa karta tha. (Imam Ibne-Maja (Rahimahullah) key shagrid) Abul-Hasan bin Salma ney kaha : hamein Abu Hatim ney Abu Nuaim sey unhoney Abdur-Rehman bin Sabit bin Soban sey isi tarah hadees bayan ki."
"414","Haddasana Abdur Rahman bin Ibrahim al-Dimashqi, haddasana al-Waleed bin Muslim, haddasana al-Awza'i, an al-Muttalib bin Abdullah bin Hantab, an Ibn Umar (radi Allahu anhuma), ke unhone wuzu kiya teen teen baar, aur ise Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki taraf mansub kiya."
"415","Hazrat Aaysha (Raziallahu anha) aur Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Nabi Akram (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney teen teen baar aaza (angon ko) dho kar wuzu kiya."
"416","Hazrat Abdullah bin Abi Oofaa (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : mainey Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ko dekha ke aap ney teen teen baar (aaza (angon ko) dho kar) wuzu kiya aur sar ka masah eik baar kiya."
"417","Hazrat Abu-Malik Ash-ari (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) teen teen baar (wuzu ke angon ko dho kar) wuzu kartey they."
"418","Haddasana Abu Bakr bin Abi Shaybah aur Ali bin Muhammad, unhonne kaha: haddasana Wakee', an Sufyan, an Abdullah bin Muhammad bin Aqeel, an al-Rubayyi' bint Mu'awwidh bin Afra (radi Allahu anha), ke Rasool Allah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne wuzu kiya teen teen baar."
"419","Hazrat Abdullah bin umr (Raziallahu anhuma) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney eik eik baar wuzu kiya aur farmaya : ye wo wuzu hai jis key baghair Allah Taala namaz qubul nahin farmata. phir do do baar wuzu kiya to farmaya : ye maqam aur martaba rakhney wala wuzu hai. aur teen teen baar wuzu kiya to farmaya : ye sab sey kamil wuzu hai. ye mera aur Hazrat Ibraheem Khaleelullah ka wuzu hai. jo shakhs is tarah wuzu karey phir farigh ho kar padhey : (أَشْهَدُ أَنْ لاَ إِلَهَ إِلاَّ اللَّهُ ، وَأَشْهَدُ أَنَّ مُحَمَّدًا عَبْدُهُ وَرَسُولُهُ) \main gawahi deta hun ke Allah key siwa koi mabood nahin aur main gawahi deta hun ke Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam)  Allah key bandey aur uskey Rasool hain. to uskey liye jannat key aathon darwazey khul jatey hain jis mein sey wo chahey dakhil ho jaey."""""
"420","Haddasana Ja'far bin Musafir, haddasana Isma'il bin Qa'nab Abu Bishr, haddasana Abdullah bin 'Arada al-Shaybani, Zayd bin al-Hawari se, Mu'awiyah bin Qurra se, 'Ubayd bin 'Umayr se, Ubayy bin Ka'b se riwayat hai ke Rasool Allah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ne paani manga aur wuzu kiya ek ek baar, phir farmaya: \Yeh wuzu ki farziyat hai.\"" Ya farmaya: \""Wuzu hai jise na kiya to Allah uski namaz qabool nahi karega.\"" Phir do do baar wuzu kiya"","" phir farmaya: \""Yeh wuzu hai jise karne par Allah dohra ajr dega.\"" Phir teen teen baar wuzu kiya"","" phir farmaya: \""Yeh mera wuzu hai aur mujh se pehle rasoolo ka wuzu.\"""""""
"421","Haddasana Muhammad bin Bashar, haddasana Abu Dawood, haddasana Kharjah bin Mus'ab, Yunus bin 'Ubayd se, al-Hasan se, 'Utayy bin Damrah al-Sa'di se, Ubayy bin Ka'b se, unhone kaha: Rasool Allah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ne farmaya: \Beshaq wuzu ka ek shaitan hai jiska naam Walahan hai"","" to paani ke waswase se bacho.\"""""""
"422","Hazrat Abdullah bin Amr bin Aas (Raziallahu anhuma) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : eik Erabi (dehati) (dehaati) Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir huwa aur aap sey wuzu key barey mein sawal kiya. aap (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney isey teen teen baar (aaza (angon ko) dho kar) wuzu kar key dikhaya, phir farmaya : wuzu ye hota hai, jisney is par izafa kiya, usney bura kiya, had sey tajawuz kiya (badhna) aur zulm kiya."
"423","Hazrat Abdullah bin Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : main raat ko apni khaala (Ummul-momenin) Hazrat Memuna (Raziallahu anha) key yahaan thehra. (raat ko) Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) uthey, aap ney eik mashk sey wuzu kiya aur wuzu bhi mukhtasar kiya (kam pani istimal kiya) main utha aur mainey bhi wesey hi kiya jaisey aap (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney kiya tha."
"424","Hazrat Abdullah bin umr (Raziallahu anhuma) sey riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney eik shakhs ko wuzu kartey dekha to farmaya : fuzul kharchi na karo, fuzul kharchi na karo."
"425","Hazrat Abdullah bin Amr (Raziallahu anhuma) sey riwayat hai ke Hazrat Saad (Raziallahu anhu) wuzu kar rahey they. Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) paas sey guzrey to farmaya : ye kya israaf (fuzul kharchi) hai? unhoney kaha : kya wuzu mein bhi israaf (fuzul kharch) hota hai? farmaya : haan, agar-che tum behtey darya par (uskey kinarey bethey) ho."
"426","Haddasana Ahmad bin 'Abda, haddasana Hammad bin Zayd, haddasana Musa bin Salim Abu Jahdam, haddasana Abdullah bin 'Ubaydillah bin Abbas, Ibn Abbas se riwayat hai ke unhone kaha: Rasool Allah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ne humein wuzu mukammal karne ka hukm diya."
"427","Hazrat Abu-Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke unhoney Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ko ye farmatey suna : kya main tumhen wo aa'maal na bataun jinki wajeh sey Allah Taala ghaltiyaan maaf farma deta hai aur nekiyon mein izafa farma deta hai? Sahaba ney arz kiya : kyon nahin ! Allah key Rasool ! aap (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya is waqt kamil (sanwaar kar) wuzu karna jab (sardi waghera ki wajeh sey) dil na chahta ho, aur masjidon ki taraf ziyada qadam uthana, aur eik namaz key baad dusri namaz ka intizar karna."
"428","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : ghaltiyon key kaffaarey ye hain is waqt kamil wuzu karna jab dil na chahta ho, aur masjidon ki taraf (chalney key liye) paon kaam mein lana aur namaz key baad namaz ka intizar karna."
"429","(A) Haddasana Muhammad bin Abi 'Umar al-'Adani, haddasana Sufyan, 'Abdul Karim Abu Umayya se, Hassan bin Bilal se, 'Ammar bin Yasir se. (B) Haddasana Ibn Abi 'Umar, kaha: Haddasana Sufyan, Sa'eed bin Abi 'Arooba se, Qatada se, Hassan bin Bilal se, 'Ammar bin Yasir se. Unhone kaha: Maine Rasool Allah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ko daadi ka khilal karte dekha."
"430","Haddasana Muhammad bin Abi Khalid al-Qazwini, haddasana 'Abdur Razzaq, Isra'il se, 'Amir bin Shaqiq al-Asadi se, Abu Wa'il se, 'Uthman se riwayat hai ke Rasool Allah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ne wuzu kiya aur daadi ka khilal kiya."
"431","Haddasana Muhammad bin Abdullah bin Hafs bin Hisham bin Zayd bin Anas bin Malik, haddasana Yahya bin Katheer Abu an-Nadr, Sahib al-Basri, Yazid ar-Raqashi se, Anas bin Malik se riwayat hai ke unhone kaha: Rasool Allah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) jab wuzu karte to daadi ka khilal karte aur ungliyon ko do baar kholte."
"432","Hazrat Abdullah bin umr (Raziallahu anhuma) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) jab wuzu kartey they to rukhsaaron key baalon ko thoda sa maltey they. phir daadhi mein nichey ki taraf ungliyan dal kar Khilal kartey they."
"433","Haddasana Isma'il bin Abdullah ar-Raqqi, haddasana Muhammad bin Rabi'a al-Kilabi, haddasana Wasil bin as-Sa'ib ar-Raqashi, Abu Sawra se, Abu Ayyub al-Ansari se riwayat hai ke unhone kaha: Maine Rasool Allah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ko wuzu karte dekha, phir aap ne daadi ka khilal kiya."
"434","Hazrat Amr bin Yahya apney walid sey riwayat kartey hain ke unhoney (apney walid) Amr bin Yahya key dada Hazrat Abdullah bin Zaid (Raziallahu anhu) sey arz kiya : kya aap mujhey (amali taur par) dikha saktey hain ke Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) kis tarah wuzu kartey they? Hazrat Abdullah bin Zaid (Raziallahu anhu) ney farmaya : haan (abhi dikha deta hun.) unhoney pani talab farmaya , phir apney haathon par pani dal kar do baar haath dhoey. phir teen baar kulli ki aur naak saaf ki, phir teen baar chehra dhoya, phir kohniyon tak bazu do do baar dhoey, phir dono haathon sey sar ka masah kiya, (masaeh key doran mein) haathon ko aagey bhi laye aur peechhey bhi ley gaey. (masah karna) sar key agley hissey sey shuru kiya, phir guddi tak haathon ko ley gaey, phir wapis isi jagah ley aaye jahan sey shuru kiya tha. iskey baad dono paon dhoey."
"435","Hazrat Usman bin Affaan (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : mainey Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ko dekha ke aap ney wuzu kiya to sar ka masah eik hi baar kiya."
"436","Haddasana Hannad bin as-Sari, haddasana Abu al-Ahwas, Abu Ishaq se, Abu Hayya se, 'Ali se riwayat hai ke Rasool Allah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ne apne sar ka ek baar masah kiya."
"437","Hazrat Salma bin Akwaa (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : mainey Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ko dekha ke aap ney wuzu kiya to sar ka masah eik baar kiya."
"438","Haddasana Abu Bakr bin Abi Shayba aur 'Ali bin Muhammad, dono ne kaha: Haddasana Waki', Sufyan se, Abdullah bin Muhammad bin 'Aqil se, ar-Rubayyi' bint Mu'awwidh bin 'Afra se riwayat hai ke unhone kaha: Rasool Allah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ne wuzu kiya aur apne sar ka do baar masah kiya."
"439","Hazrat Abdullah bin Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) sey riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney (wuzu key doran mein) kanon ka masah kiya. un ki andruni taraf ka masah shahadat ki ungliyon sey kiya aur angoothey kanon key bahar ki taraf ley aaye phir unka bahar aur andar sey masah kiya."
"440","Haddasana Abu Bakr bin Abi Shayba, haddasana Shareek, haddasana Abdullah bin Muhammad bin 'Aqil, ar-Rubayyi' se riwayat hai ke Nabi (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam)"
"441","Hazrat Rabee binte Muawwiz ibne Ifraa (Raziallahu anha) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney wuzu kiya to apney kanon key suraakhon mein ungliyan dakhil kin."
"442","Hazrat Miqdam bin Maadikarb (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney wuzu kiya to sar ka masah kiya, aur kanon ka bhi bahar andar sey masah kiya."
"443","Hazrat Abdullah bin Zaid (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : kaan sar mein shamil hain."
"444","Hazrat Abu-Umama (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : kaan sar mein shamil hain. aur aap (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) eik baar sar ka masah kartey they aur aakhon key konon ka masah kartey they."
"445","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : kaan sar ka hissa hain."
"446","Hazrat Mustaurid bin Shaddad (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai unhoney farmaya : mainey dekha ke Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney wuzu kiya to haath ki chhoti ungli sey apney dono qadmon ki ungliyon ka Khilal farmaya. (Imam Ibne-Maja (Rahimahullah) key shagrid) Abul-Hasan Al-Qattan ney yehi riwayat apni sanad sey Rasoolullah Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam sey isi tarah bayan ki hai."
"447","Hazrat Abdullah bin Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) sey riwayat hai, Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : jab to namaz key liye uthey to kamil wuzu kar, aur haathon aur paon ki ungliyon key darmiyan pani pahuncha."
"448","Hazrat Aasim bin Laqeet bin Sabra apney walid sey riwayat kartey hain ke Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : kamil wuzu kar aur ungliyon mein Khilal kar."
"449","Hazrat Abu-Raafey (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) jab wuzu kartey they to apni angoothi ko harkat detey they (taa ke uskey nichey bhi pani pahunch jaey)."
"450","Hazrat Abdullah bin Amr (Raziallahu anhuma) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney kuchh logon ko wuzu kartey dekha, (aap ney dekha ke jo afrad wuzu kar chukey they) un ki eidiyaan chamak rahi thin. (jo paon achchhi tarah na dhoney ki wajeh sey wazeh tor par khushk nazar aa rahi thin) aap (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : ediyon key liye aag ka azab hai, wuzu achchhi tarah mukammal karo."
"451","Hazrat Aaysha (Raziallahu anha) sey riwayat hai, Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : ediyon key liye aag ka azab hai."
"452","Hazrat abu-Salma (Rahimahullah) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : Hazrat Aaysha (Raziallahu anha) ney (apney bhai) Hazrat Abdur-Rehman (Raziallahu anhu) ko wuzu kartey dekha to farmaya : kamil wuzu kiya karo kyonkey mainey Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) sey ye farman suna hai : ediyon key liye aag ka azab hai."
"453","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : ediyon key liye aag ka azab hai."
"454","Haddasana Abu Bakr bin Abi Shaiba, haddasana Abul Ahwas, an Abi Ishaq, an Saeed bin Abi Karib, an Jabir bin Abdullah, kaha maine suna Rasul Allah ﷺ farmate the: \Wail hai araqib (panjon) ke liye aag se.\"""""""
"455","Haddasana Abbas bin Usman aur Usman bin Ismail Dimishqi, dono ne kaha haddasana Walid bin Muslim, haddasana Shaiba bin Ahnaf, an Abi Sallam Aswad, an Abi Salih Ash'ari, haddasani Abu Abdullah Ash'ari, an Khalid bin Walid aur Yazid bin Abi Sufyan aur Shurahbil bin Hasana aur Amr bin Aas, in sabhon ne Rasul Allah ﷺ se suna, aapne farmaya: \Wazu mukammal karo"","" wail hai aaqab (ediyon) ke liye aag se.\"""""""
"456","Hazrat Abu-Haiya (Rahimahullah) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : mainey Hazrat Ali (Raziallahu anhu) ko dekha ke unhoney wuzu kiya to apney dono qadam takhnon tak dhoey, phir farmaya : mainey chaha ke tum logon ko tumharey Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) key wuzu ka tariqa (amali tor par) dikha dun."
"457","Haddasana Hisham bin Ammar, haddasana Walid bin Muslim, haddasana Hariz bin Usman, an Abdur Rahman bin Maisara, an Miqdad bin Ma'dikarib, ke Rasul Allah ﷺ ne wazu kiya aur apne paaon ko teen teen baar dhoya."
"458","Hazrat Rabee (Raziallahu anha) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : Hazrat Abdullah bin Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) merey paas tashrif laye aur mujh sey is hadees key mutalliq daryaft kiya, yani wo hadees jis mein unhoney zikr kiya ke Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney wuzu kiya to paon dhoey (jab Hazrat Rabee (Raziallahu anhu) ney hadees bayan ki to) Hazrat Abdullah bin Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) ney farmaya : log paon dhoney ka zikr kartey hain, mujhey to Quran Majeed mein sirf maseh ka zikr milta hai."
"459","Haddasana Muhammad bin Bashar, haddasana Muhammad bin Ja'far, haddasana Shu'ba, an Jami' bin Shaddad Abi Sakhr, kaha maine suna Humran ko Abu Burda se masjid mein bayan karte ke unhone suna Usman bin Affan se ke woh Nabi ﷺ se riwayat karte the, aapne farmaya: \Jisne wazu ko mukammal kiya jaise Allah ne use hukm diya"","" to farz namazein unke darmiyan ke gunahon ke liye kaffara ban jati hain.\"""""""
"460","Haddasana Muhammad bin Yahya, haddasana Hajjaj, haddasana Hammam, haddasana Ishaq bin Abdullah bin Abi Talha, haddasani Ali bin Yahya bin Khallad, an apne walid se, an apne chacha se, Rifa'a bin Rafi se ke woh Nabi ﷺ ke paas baithe the, to aapne farmaya: \Kisi ki namaaz mukammal nahi hoti jab tak woh wazu ko mukammal na kare jaise Allah Ta'ala ne hukm diya"","" apna chehra aur apne haath kohniyon tak dhoye"","" aur apne sar ka masah kare"","" aur apne paaon takhnon tak dhoye.\"""""""
"461","Haddasana Abu Bakr bin Abi Shaiba, haddasana Muhammad bin Bishr, haddasana Zakariya bin Abi Zaida, unhone kaha Mansoor ne kaha haddasana Mujahid, an Hakam bin Sufyan Saqafi ke unhone dekha Rasul Allah ﷺ ne wazu kiya, phir ek chullu paani liya aur usse apni sharmgah par chidak diya."
"462","Hazrat Zaid bin Harisa (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : Hazrat Jibril (Alaihissalam) ney mujhey wuzu karney ka tariqa bataya, aur mujhey hukm diya ke main wuzu key baad aa janey waley peshab (key qatron key shubha sey bachney) key liye kapdey key nichey chheentey maar liya karun. (Imam Ibne-Maja (Rahimahullah) key shagrid) abul-Hasan bin Salma ney ibne Labiaa key doosrey do shagirdon Abu Hatim aur Abdullah bin Yusuf Al Taneesi sey isi tarah riwayat bayan ki."
"463","Haddasana Husain bin Salama Yahmadi, haddasana Salm bin Qutaiba, haddasana Hasan bin Ali Hashimi, an Abdur Rahman A'raj, an Abu Huraira, kaha Rasul Allah ﷺ ne farmaya: \Jab tum wazu karo to sharmgah par paani chidak lo.\"""""""
"464","Haddasana Muhammad bin Yahya, haddasana Asim bin Ali, haddasana Qais, an Ibn Abi Laila, an Abi Zubair, an Jabir, kaha Rasul Allah ﷺ ne wazu kiya, phir apni sharmgah par paani chidak diya."
"465","Hazrat Umme-Haani bint Abu-Talib (Raziallahu anha) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : jis saal Makka Fateh huwa Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) nahaney key pani ki taraf gaey, Hazrat Fatima (Raziallahu anha) ney Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) key liye parda taan diya (to aap (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney ghusl farmaya), uskey baad aap ney apna kapda ley kar jism par lapet liya ."
"466","Hazrat Qais bin Saad (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) hamarey yahan tashrif laye, hamney aap key liye pani rakha to aap ney ghusl farmaya. hamney aap (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ko waras sey rangi hui eik chadar pesh ki to aap ney wo chadar odh li. (mujhey wo manzar is tarah yad hai) goya main (ab bhi) aap key pet Mubarak key shikan par waras ka nishan dekh raha hun ."
"467","Hazrat ummul-momenin Memuna (Raziallahu anha) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : jab Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney ghusle-janabat kya to mainey aap ki khidmat mein kapda (tauliya waghera) pesh kya, aap (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney isey wapis kar diya aur (jism par sey haath key sath) pani jhaadney lagey ."
"468","Haddasana Abbas bin Walid aur Ahmad bin Azhar, dono ne kaha haddasana Marwan bin Muhammad, haddasana Yazid bin Simt, haddasana Wazin bin Ata, an Mahfuz bin Alqama, an Salman Farsi, ke Rasul Allah ﷺ ne wazu kiya, phir apne jism par oon ki jubba ulat di aur us se apne chehra ko ponch liya."
"469","Hazrat Anas bin Malik (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : jis shakhs ney wuzu kya aur khub achi tarah wuzu kya, phir teen baar yun kaha : (أَشْهَدُ أَنْ لاَ إِلَهَ إِلاَّ اللَّهُ وَحْدَہُ لَا شَرِیْکَ لَهُ ، وَأَشْهَدُ أَنَّ مُحَمَّدًا عَبْدُهُ وَرَسُولُهُ) 'main gawahi deta hun ke akeley Allah key siwa koi mabood nahin, uska koi shareek nahin, aur main gawahi deta hun ke Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) uskey bandey aur uskey Rasool hain. uskey liye jannat key aathon darwazey khol diye jatey hain, wo jis mein sey chahey dakhil ho jaey . Imam Ibne-Maja (Rahimahullah) key shagrid (abul-Hasan bin Salma al-Qattan ney kaha ke Abu-Nuem key shagrid Ibrahim bin Nasar ney sabiqa riwayat ki misl bayan ki."
"470","Hazrat umr bin Khattab (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : jo bhi musalman wuzu karta hai aur wuzu bhi achcha karta hai, phir kehta hai : (أَشْهَدُ أَنْ لاَ إِلَهَ إِلاَّ اللَّهُ ، وَأَشْهَدُ أَنَّ مُحَمَّدًا عَبْدُهُ وَرَسُولُهُ) 'mein gawahi deta hun ke akeley Allah key siwa koi mabood nahin, uska koi shareek nahin, aur main gawahi deta hun ke Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam)  uskey bandey aur uskey Rasool hain. uskey liye jannat key aathon darwazey khol diye jatey hain, wo jis mein sey chahey dakhil ho jaey ."
"471","Haddasana Abu Bakr bin Abi Shaiba, haddasana Ahmad bin Abdullah, an Abdul Aziz bin Majishun, haddasana Amr bin Yahya, an apne walid se, an Abdullah bin Zaid (Nabi ke sahabi), unhone kaha: Hamare paas Rasul Allah ﷺ tashrif laaye, to humne unke liye paani nikaala ek pital ke bartan mein, to aapne usse wazu kiya."
"472","Haddasana Yaqub bin Humaid bin Kasib, haddasana Abdul Aziz bin Muhammad Darawardi, an Ubaidullah bin Umar, an Ibrahim bin Muhammad bin Abdullah bin Jahsh, an apne walid se, an Zainab bint Jahsh, ke unke paas pital ka ek bartan (mikhdab) tha, unhone kaha: Main Rasul Allah ﷺ ke sar mein usi mein kanghi karti thi."
"473","Haddasana Abu Bakr bin Abi Shaiba aur Ali bin Muhammad, dono ne kaha haddasana Wakee, an Shareek, an Ibrahim bin Jarir, an Abi Zur'a bin Amr bin Jarir, an Abu Huraira, ke Nabi ﷺ ne ek bartan (tor) mein wazu kiya."
"474","Hazrat Aaysha (Raziallahu anha) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) so jatey they yahan tak key kharratey leney lagtey, phir khadey ho kar namaz padhtey aur wuzu na kartey. Wakee bayan kartey hain ke ummul-momenin ki murad ye hai ke aap (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ko baaz oqaat sajdey mein neend aa jati thi ."
"475","Haddasana Abdullah bin Amir bin Zurara, haddasana Yahya bin Zakariya bin Abi Zaida, an Hajjaj, an Fuzail bin Amr, an Ibrahim, an Alqama, an Abdullah (Ibn Masood), ke Rasul Allah ﷺ is tarah soye ke aapke been ki aawaz aayi, phir aapne uth kar namaaz parhi."
"476","Haddasana Abdullah bin Amir bin Zurara, an Ibn Abi Zaida, an Huraith bin Abi Matar, an Yahya bin Abbad Abi Hubaira Ansari, an Saeed bin Jubair, an Ibn Abbas, kaha: Aap (Nabi ﷺ) ki woh neend is tarah thi ke woh baithe hue the."
"477","Haddasana Muhammad bin Musaffa Himsi, haddasana Baqiyya, an Wazin bin Ata, an Mahfuz bin Alqama, an Abdur Rahman bin A'iz Azdi, an Ali bin Abi Talib, ke Rasul Allah ﷺ ne farmaya: \Aankh maqad ka bandh hai"","" to jo koi soye woh wazu kare.\"""""""
"478","Hazrat Safwan bin Assaal (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) hamen hukm detey they ke hum teen din tak apney mozey na utaaren siwaye iskey ke janabat ki wajeh sey (ghusl karna padey. tab to utaarna hi padengey) lekin peshaab, pakhaney ya neend ki wajeh sey (mozey utaarney ki zarurat nahin.)"
"479","Haddasana Muhammad bin Abdullah bin Numair, haddasana Abdullah bin Idris, an Hisham bin Urwa, an apne walid se, an Marwan bin Hakam, an Busra bint Safwan, unhone kaha Rasul Allah ﷺ ne farmaya: \Jab tum mein se koi apni sharmgah (zakar) chhu le to wazu kare.\"""""""
"480","Haddasana Ibrahim bin Munzir Hizami, haddasana Ma'n bin Isa aur (change) haddasana Abdur Rahman bin Ibrahim Dimishqi, haddasana Abdullah bin Nafi', sab ne Ibn Abi Zi'b se, an Uqba bin Abdur Rahman, an Muhammad bin Abdur Rahman bin Thawban, an Jabir bin Abdullah, kaha Rasul Allah ﷺ ne farmaya: \Jab tum mein se koi apni sharmgah (zakar) chhu le to us par wazu wajib hai.\"""""""
"481","Haddasana Abu Bakr bin Abi Shaiba, haddasana Mu'alla bin Mansoor aur (change) haddasana Abdullah bin Ahmad bin Bashir bin Zakwan Dimishqi, haddasana Marwan bin Muhammad, dono ne kaha haddasana Haisam bin Humaid, haddasana Ala bin Haris, an Makhool, an Anbasa bin Abi Sufyan, an Umm Habiba, unhone kaha maine suna Rasul Allah ﷺ se aap farmate the: \Jisne apni sharmgah (farj) ko chhua"","" woh wazu kare.\"""""""
"482","Haddasana Sufyan bin Wakee, haddasana Abdus Salam bin Harb, an Ishaq bin Abi Farwa, an Zuhri, an Abdullah bin Abd Qari, an Abu Ayyub, kaha maine suna Rasul Allah ﷺ se aap farmate the: \Jisne apni sharmgah (farj) ko chhua"","" woh wazu kare.\"""""""
"483","Hazrat Qais bin Talaq Hanfi apney walid (Hazrat Talaq bin Ali (Raziallahu anhu)) sey riwayat kartey hain, unhoney farmaya : mainey suna ke kisi ney Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) sey uzue-khaas ko haath laganey key barey mein sawal kya to aap (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : is sey wuzu lazim nahin aata , wo bhi tera eik hissa hai.'"
"484","Haddasana Amr bin Usman bin Saeed bin Kathir bin Dinar Himsi, haddasana Marwan bin Muawiya, an Ja'far bin Zubair, an Qasim, an Abu Umama, kaha Rasul Allah ﷺ se sharmgah (zakar) chhune ke mutalliq poocha gaya to aapne farmaya: \Woh to bas tere jism ka ek hissa hai.\"""""""
"485","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : jis chiz mein aag tabdili kar dey , us (key khaney ki wajeh) sey wuzu karo . Hazrat Abdullah bin Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) ney farmaya : kya main garm pani (pi kar uski wajeh) sey bhi wuzu karun? Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ney farmaya : bhatijey ! jab tum Rasoolullah ki koi hadees suno , to misalen na bayan kya karo ."
"486","Hazrat Aaysha (Raziallahu anha) sey riwayat hai, Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : jis chiz ko aag ney chhua ho, us (key khaney peeney ki wajeh) sey wuzu karo ."
"487","Hazrat Yazeed bin abu-Malik (Rahimahullah) sey riwayat hai, unhoney Hazrat Anas bin Malik (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat ki ke wo apney haath apney kanon par rakh kar farmatey they : (ye kaan) behrey ho jaeyn, agar mainey Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ko ye farmatey na suna ho : jis chiz ko aag ney chhua ho, uski wajeh sey wuzu karo ."
"488","Hazrat Abdullah bin Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney (bakri key) shaaney ka gosht khaya, phir apney haath us taat sey saaf kar liye jo aapkey nichey bicha huwa tha, phir aap namaz key liye khadey huye aur namaz ada ki."
"489","Humein Hadees bayan ki Muhammad bin al-Sabbah ne, khabar di Sufyan bin Uyainah ne, Muhammad bin al-Munkadir, Amr bin Dinar aur Abdullah bin Muhammad bin Aqeel se, unhon ne Jabir bin Abdullah se riwayat ki. Unhon ne kaha: Nabi ﷺ, Abu Bakr aur Umar ne roti aur gosht khaya aur unhone wuzu nahi kiya."
"490","Imam Zohri (Rahimahullah) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : main ( khalifa) Waleed ya (khalifa) Abdul-Malik key sath raat key khaney par mojud tha. jab namaz ka waqt huwa to main wuzu karney key liye uth khada huwa . to Hazrat Jaafar bin Amr bin Umayya ney farmaya : main apney walid (Hazrat Amr (Raziallahu anhu)) key barey mein gawahi deta hun ke unhoney Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) key barey mein gawahi di ke aap ney aag sey tayyar shuda khana khaya , aur phir naya wuzu kiye baghair namaz ada farmaai. (is par) Hazrat Ali bin Abdullah bin Abbas ney farmaya : main bhi apney walid (Hazrat Abdullah bin Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) ) key barey mein yehi gawahi deta hun ."
"491","Hazrat Umme-Salma (Raziallahu anha) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ki khidmat mein bakri key kandhey ka gosht pesh kya gaya . aap ney is mein sey khaya , phir namaz padhi aur pani ko haath bhi na lagaya ."
"492","Hazrat Suwed bin Noman Ansari (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Sahaba Raziallahu anhum Allah key Rasool (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) key sath khaibar ki taraf ( jihad key liye) rawana huye . jab wo maqam Sehba par pahunchey to Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney Asr ki namaz ada ki phir khana talab farmaya to aap ki khidmat mein sirf sattu pesh kiye gaey (aur koi chiz mojud nahin thi), sab ney khaya piya. phir aap (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney pani talab farmaya aur kulli ki, phir khadey ho kar hamen maghrib ki namaz padhaai."
"493","Humein Hadees bayan ki Muhammad bin Abdul Malik bin Abi al-Shawarib ne, sunai Abdul Aziz bin al-Mukhtar ne, sunai Sohail ne apne walid se, unhon ne Abu Hurairah se riwayat ki ke Rasool Allah ﷺ ne bhed ka shana (kandh) khaya, phir kully ki aur apne haath dhoye, aur namaz parhi."
"494","Humein Hadees bayan ki Abu Bakr bin Abi Shaibah ne, sunai Abdullah bin Idrees aur Abu Muawiyah ne, unhon ne kaha sunai al-A'mash ne Abdullah bin Abdullah se, unhon ne Abdul Rehman bin Abi Laila se, unhon ne Bara bin Azib se riwayat ki. Unhon ne kaha Rasool Allah ﷺ se oont ke gosht ke wuzu ke baare mein poocha gaya to aap ne farmaya: \Us se wuzu karo.\"""""""
"495","Humein Hadees bayan ki Muhammad bin Bashar ne, sunai Abdul Rehman bin Mahdi ne, sunai Zaidah aur Israeel ne, Ash'as bin Abi al-Sha'asa se, unhon ne Jafar bin Abi Thaur se, unhon ne Jabir bin Samurah se riwayat ki. Unhon ne kaha Rasool Allah ﷺ ne humein hukm diya ke oont ke gosht se wuzu karo aur bakri ke gosht se wuzu na karo."
"496","Humein Hadees bayan ki Abu Ishaq al-Harwi Ibraheem bin Abdullah bin Hatim ne, sunai Abbad bin al-Awwam ne, Hajjaj se, unhon ne Abdullah bin Abdullah (jo Bani Hashim ke ghulam the aur siqa the aur Hakam un se riwayat karte the) se, humein Hadees sunai Abdul Rehman bin Abi Laila ne Usaid bin Huzair se, unhon ne kaha Rasool Allah ﷺ ne farmaya: \Bakri ke doodh se wuzu na karo aur oont ke doodh se wuzu karo.\"""""""
"497","Humein Hadees bayan ki Muhammad bin Yahya ne, sunai Yazid bin Abd Rabbah ne, sunai Baqiyah ne, Khalid bin Yazid bin Umar bin Habeerah al-Fazari se, unhon ne Ata bin Sa'ib se, unhon ne kaha maine Muharib bin Disar ko kehte suna, maine Abdullah bin Umar ko kehte suna, maine Rasool Allah ﷺ ko farmate suna: \Oont ke gosht se wuzu karo aur bakri ke gosht se wuzu na karo"","" aur oont ke doodh se wuzu karo aur bakri ke doodh se wuzu na karo"","" aur bakriyon ke baar (baade) mein namaz parho aur oonton ke baithne ki jagah (ma'atin) mein namaz na parho.\"""""""
"498","Humein Hadees bayan ki Abdul Rehman bin Ibraheem al-Dimashqi ne, sunai al-Waleed bin Muslim ne, sunai al-Auza'i ne, al-Zuhri se, unhon ne Ubaidullah bin Abdullah bin Utbah se, unhon ne Ibn Abbas se riwayat ki ke Nabi ﷺ ne farmaya: \Doodh se kully kar liya karo kyun ke us mein chiknayi (dassam) hoti hai.\"""""""
"499","Humein Hadees bayan ki Abu Bakr bin Abi Shaibah ne, sunai Khalid bin Makhlad ne, Moosa bin Yaqoob se, mujhe Hadees sunai Abu Ubaidah bin Abdullah bin Zam'ah ne apne walid se, unhon ne Nabi ﷺ ki biwi Umm Salamah se riwayat ki. Unhon ne kaha Rasool Allah ﷺ ne farmaya: \Jab tum doodh piyo to kully kar liya karo"","" kyun ke us mein chiknayi hoti hai.\"""""""
"500","Hazrat Sehal bin Saad Saaidi (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : doodh pi kar kulli kar liya karo kyonkey is mein chiknaahat hoti hai."
"501","Humein Hadees bayan ki Ishaq bin Ibraheem al-Sawwaq ne, sunai Zahhak bin Makhlad ne, sunai Zama bin Salih ne, Ibn Shihab (al-Zuhri) se, unhon ne Anas bin Malik se riwayat ki. Unhon ne kaha Rasool Allah ﷺ ne bakri ka doodh doya aur uska doodh piya, phir pani mangwa kar kully ki aur farmaya: \Beshak us mein chiknayi hoti hai.\"""""""
"502","Janab Urwa Hazrat Aaysha (Raziallahu anha) sey riwayat kartey hain unhoney farmaya : Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney apni eik biwi ka bosa liya , phir namaz key liye tashrif ley gaey, aur wuzu nahin kya. ( Urwa kehtey hain) mainey kaha : wo zarur aap hi hongi to aap hans din."
"503","Hazrat Aaysha (Raziallahu anha) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) wuzu kartey , phir bosa letey aur (dobara) wuzu kiye baghair namaz padh letey , aur baaz oqaat aap merey sath bhi ye kartey ."
"504","Humein Hadees bayan ki Abu Bakr bin Abi Shaibah ne, sunai Hushaim ne, Yazid bin Abi Ziyad se, unhon ne Abdul Rehman bin Abi Laila se, unhon ne Ali se riwayat ki. Unhon ne kaha Rasool Allah ﷺ se Mazdi ke baare mein poocha gaya to aap ne farmaya: \Us mein wuzu hai aur Mani mein ghusl hai.\"""""""
"505","Hazrat miqdaad bin Aswad (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, ke unhoney Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) sey daryaft kya ke agar mard apni biwi key qarib jaey aur inzaal na ho (to kya hukm hai?) aap (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : jab kisi ko ye soorate-hal pesh aaye to wo apni sharmgah par pani dal ley, yani istinja kar ley aur wuzu kar ley."
"506","Hazrat Sehal bin Hanif (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : mujhey mazi ki wajeh sey bahut mashaqqat bardasht kerni padti thi (kyonkey) main uski wajeh sey bahut kasrat sey (baar baar) ghusl karta tha. chunanche mainey Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) sey daryaft kya to aap ney farmaya : tujhey us sey wuzu kafi hai. mainey kaha : aey Allah key Rasool ! jo merey kapdey ko lag jaey uska kya karun? farmaya : tujhey pani ka eik chullu kafi hai. jahan tera khayal hai ke wo lag gaee hai wahan (chullu bhar pani) chhidak dey."
"507","Hazrat Abdullah bin Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) sey riwayat hai ke wo Hazrat umr (Raziallahu anhu) key sath Hazrat Ubai-bin Kaab (Raziallahu anhu) key yahan gaey . wo ( ghar sey) bahar tashrif laye. (baat cheet key doran Hazrat Ubai ney) farmaya : mujhey mazi aa gaee thi to mainey uzue-khaas ko dho kar wuzu kya hai. ( isliye bahar aaney mein der hui) Hazrat umr (Raziallahu anhu) ney farmaya : kya ye ( wuzu kar lena) kafi hota hai? unhoney kaha : ji haan . farmaya : kya aap ney ye masla Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) sey (khud) suna hai? unhoney kaha : ji haan ."
"508","Hazrat Abdullah bin Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) sey riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) raat ko uth kar baitulkhalaa tashrif ley gaey aur zaruri hajat sey farigh huye. phir Chehrey Mubarak aur dono haath dhoey aur so gaey. Imam Ibne-Maja (Rahimahullah) ney kaha : hamein abu-Bakar bin Khallad Baahli ney yahyaa bin Saeed sey , unhoney Shoba sey , unhoney Salma bin Kuheil sey unhoney Bakeer sey , unhoney Kureb sey , unhoney ibne-Abbas key wastey sey Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) sey isi ki jaisi riwayat bayan ki."
"509","Hazrat Anas bin Malik (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) har namaz key liye wuzu kiya kartey they, jabke hum log tamam namazein eik wuzu sey padh liya kartey they."
"510","Suleman (Alaihissalam) bin Barida (Rahimahullah) apney walid (Hazrat Barida bin Haseeb Aslami (Raziallahu anhu)) sey riwayat kartey hain, unhoney farmaya : Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) har namaz key liye (naya) wuzu kiya kartey they. jis din Makka Fateh huwa , us din aap (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney sab namazein eik hi wuzu sey ada farmaaeen."
"511","Hazrat Fazal bin Mubashshir (Rahimahullah) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : mainey Hazrat Jabir bin Abdullah (Raziallahu anhuma) ko eik wuzu sey kaee namazein padhtey dekha. (Hazrat Fazal ney farmaya :) mainey kaha : aap ney ye kya kiya? unhoney farmaya : mainey Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ko isi tarah kartey dekha tha, chunanche main bhi wesay hi karta hun jis tarah Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney kiya tha."
"512","Hazrat abu-Ghutef Hazli (Rahimahullah) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : main masjid mein Hazrat Abdullah bin umr bin Khattab (Raziallahu anhuma) ki majlis mein unkey irshadat sun raha tha. jab namaz ka waqt huwa to unhoney uth kar wuzu kiya aur namaz padhi , phir apni jagah par aa bethey , phir jab Asr ki namaz ka waqt huwa to aap ney uth kar wuzu kiya, namaz padhi , aur phir apni jagah par aa bethey . phir jab maghrib ki namaz ka waqt huwa to aap ney uth kar wuzu kiya, namaz padhi , phir apni jagah tashrif ley aaye. mainey arz kya : Allah Taala aap ko salaamat rakhey (ye irshad farmaiye ke) har namaz key liye wuzu karna farz hai ya sunnat? unhoney farmaya : tum ney mera ye amal mehsus kar liya? mainey kaha : ji haan. unhoney farmaya : nahin (ye farz nahin hai), agar main subah ki namaz key liye wuzu karun to uskey sath sab namazein padh sakta hun jab tak wuzu na tootey. baat ye hai ke mainey Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) sey ye irshade Mubarak suna hai : jo shakhs paak (baa-wuzoo) honey key bawajud wuzu karta hai usey das nekiyan milti hain. aur main bhi nekiyon ki raghbat (dichaspi) rakhta hun."
"513","Janab Ibaad bin Tameem (Rahimahullah) apney chacha Hazrat Abdullah bin Yazeed bin Aasim (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat kartey hain, unhoney farmaya : Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) sey arz kiya gaya ke agar koi aadmi namaz mein kuchh mehsus karey (usey shak padey ke hawa khaarij hui hai to kya kerey)?  to aap (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : nahin (wuzu karney na jaey) yahan tak key boo mehsus karey ya aawaz suney."
"514","Hazrat abu-Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) sey namaz mein) wuzu tootney ka shubha paida honey key barey mein sawal kiya gaya to aap (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : namaz chhod kar na jaey yahan tak key aawaz suney ya boo mehsus karey."
"515","Humein Hadees bayan ki Ali bin Muhammad ne, sunai Waki' ne. Aur humein Hadees bayan ki Muhammad bin Bashar ne, sunai Muhammad bin Jafar aur Abdul Rehman ne. Unhon ne kaha humein Hadees sunai Sho'ba ne Sohail bin Abi Salih se, unke walid se, unhon ne Abu Hurairah se riwayat ki. Unhon ne kaha Rasool Allah ﷺ ne farmaya: \Wuzu nahi hai magar aawaz ya badboo (rih) ki wajah se.\"""""""
"516","Hazrat Muhammad bin Amr bin Ata (Rahimahullah) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : mainey Hazrat Saaib bin Khubab (Raziallahu anhu) ko dekha ke apna kapda soongh rahey they, mainey arz ki : iski kya wajeh hai? unhoney farmaya : mainey Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ko ye farmatey suna hai : wuzu (wajib) nahin hai magar aawaz ki wajeh sey ya boo ki wajeh sey."
"517","Humein Hadees bayan ki Abu Bakr bin Khallad al-Bahili ne, sunai Yazid bin Haroon ne, khabar di Muhammad bin Ishaq ne, Muhammad bin Jafar bin al-Zubair se, unhon ne Ubaidullah bin Abdullah bin Umar se, unke walid se riwayat ki. Unhon ne kaha maine Rasool Allah ﷻ se paani ke baare mein poocha gaya jo sehra mein ho aur us par janwar aur daranday aate jaate hon, to Rasool Allah ﷺ ne farmaya: \Jab paani do qullah ho to woh kisi cheez se napak nahi hota.\"" Aur humein Hadees bayan ki Amr bin Rafi ne"","" sunai Abdullah bin Mubarak ne"","" Muhammad bin Ishaq se"","" Muhammad bin Jafar se"","" Ubaidullah bin Abdullah bin Umar se"","" unke walid se Nabi ﷺ se aisi hi riwayat hai."""""
"518","Hazrat Abdullah bin umr (Raziallahu anhuma) sey riwayat hai, Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : jab pani do ya teen matkey ho to usey koi chiz napak nahin karti. (Imam Ibne-Maja (Rahimahullah) key shagrid) Abu-Hasan bin Salma Qataan ney yehi riwayat apni aali sanad sey , yani ba-wasta Abu Hatim aur Abu-Waleed waghera, Hammad sey Imam Ibne-Maja key wastey key baghair bayan ki hai."
"519","Hazrat Abu-Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) sey Makka aur Madina key darmiyan (raastey mein) waqey un hauzon key mutalliq daryaft kiya gaya jin sey darindey, kuttey aur gadhey pani pi jatey hain, kya un (key pani) sey paakizgi hasil ki ja sakti hai (wuzu aur ghusl waghera kiya ja sakta hai)? aap (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : jo kuchh unhoney apney peton mein dal liya, wo unka hai aur jo (pani) bach gaya, wo hamarey liye paak karney wala hai."
"520","Hazrat Jabir bin Abdullah (Raziallahu anhuma) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : hum log (safar key doran mein) eik taalaab par pahunchey, dekha to us main eik gadhey ki laash padi thi. hamney us sey (pani leney sey) ijtinab kiya (bache) yahan tak key Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) hamarey paas tashrif ley aaye. aap (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : pani ko koi chiz naapak nahin karti. chunanche hamney pani piya, (janweron ko) pilaya , aur (mishkeezon waghera mein) sath ley liya."
"521","Humein Hadees bayan ki Mahmood bin Khalid aur Abbas bin al-Waleed al-Dimashqi dono ne, unhon ne kaha sunai Marwan bin Muhammad ne, sunai Rishdeen ne, khabar di Muawiyah bin Salih ne, Rashid bin Sa'd se, unhon ne Abu Umamah al-Bahili se riwayat ki. Unhon ne kaha Rasool Allah ﷺ ne farmaya: \Beshak paani ko koi cheez napak nahi karti"","" siwaye is ke ke us ki badboo"","" zaiqa ya rang par ghalib aa jaye (to napak ho jata hai).\"""""""
"522","Hazrat Lubaaba binte Haris (Raziallahu anha) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : Hazrat Husain bin Ali (Raziallahu anhuma) ney Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ki god mein peshab kar diya. mainey arz kiya : aey Allah key Rasool ! apna kapda mujhey dijiye aur khud koi aur kapda pehan lijiye. aap (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : ladkey key peshab sey to chheentey maarey jatey hain aur ladki key peshab ki wajeh sey (kapda) dhoya jata hai."
"523","Hazrat Aaysha (Raziallahu anha) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ki khidmat mein eik (doodh pine wala) bacha laya gaya. usney aap (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) (key kapdon) par peshab kar diya, aap ney wahan pani chhidak diya aur kapda dhoya nahin."
"524","Hazrat Umme Qais binte Mohsin (Raziallahu anha) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : main Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ki khidmat mein apna eik (doodh pine wala) bachcha ley kar hazir hui jo (abhi) khana nahin khata tha. usney aap (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) (key kapron) par peshab kar diya to aap (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney pani mangwaya aur is par chhidak diya."
"525","Hazrat Ali (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney doodh pine wale bachche key peshab key barey mein farmaya : ladkey key peshab par pani chhidkaa jata hai aur ladki ka peshab dhoya jata hai. Abul-Hasan bin Salma ney kaha , hamein Ahmed bin Musa ney, in ko Abu Yamaan misri ney bayan kiya ke mainey Imam Shafai (Rahimahullah) sey is hadeese nabawi key mutalliq sawal kiya (jis mein ye hukm hai ke),  ladkey key peshab par pani chhidkaa jaey aur ladki key peshab sey kapda dhoya jaey. (mainey puchha is farq ki kya wajeh hai jabkey) dono peshab eik hi chiz hain? Imam Shafai (Rahimahullah) ney farmaya : iski wajeh ye hai ke ladkey ka peshab pani aur mitti sey hai aur ladki ka peshab gosht aur khoon sey hai. phir kaha samajh gaey? mainey kaha : ji nahin (main nahin samjha) farmaya : Allah Taala ney jab Adam (Alaihissalam) ko paida kiya to (unhen mitti aur pani sey paida kiya aur) Hawwa (Alaihissalam) un ki chhoti pasli sey paida hui. goya ladkey ka peshab pani aur mitti sey wajood mein aaya hai (jis sey Adam (Alaihissalam) baney they) aur ladki ka peshab gosht aur khoon sey (jis sey Hawwa (Alaihissalam) ki paidaish hui) ab samajh gaey? mainey kaha : ji haan. unhoney farmaya : Allah tujhey is (ilm aur samajh) sey faeyda dey."
"526","Hazrat Abu-Samah (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : main Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ka khaadim huwa karta tha. aap (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ki khidmat mein Hazrat Hasan ya Hazrat Husain (Raziallahu anhuma) ko laya gaya, (wo us waqt doodh peetey bachey they), unhoney Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) key seene Mubarak par peshab kar diya. Sahaba kiram Raziallahu anhum ney dhona chaha to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : pani chhidak do kyonkey ladki ka peshab dhoya jata hai aur ladkey key peshab sey pani chhidkaa jata hai."
"527","Humein Hadees bayan ki Muhammad bin Bashar ne, sunai Abu Bakr al-Hanafi ne, sunai Usama bin Zaid ne, Amr bin Shuaib se, unhon ne Ummi Kurz se riwayat ki ke Rasool Allah ﷺ ne farmaya: \Ladke ka peshab chidak diya jata hai aur ladki ka peshab dho diya jata hai.\"""""""
"528","Hazrat Anas (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : eik baddoo ney masjid mein peshab kar diya. kuchh log (usey rokney key liye) uski taraf bhaagey. Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : uska peshab band na karo. phir pani ka eik dol mangwaya aur is par baha diya."
"529","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : Allah key Rasool (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) (masjid mein) tashrif farma they ke eik baddoo masjid mein aaya. usney kaha : aey Allah ! mujhey aur Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ko bakhsh dey aur hamarey sath kisi aur ki bakhshish na karna. Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) hans padey aur farmaya : tu ney eik wasee (badi) chiz (rehmate Ilaahi) ko mehdood kar diya. phir wo  (ea'raab) (dehaati) wapis palta. abhi masjid hi key eik hissey mein tha ke (khada ho kar) paon eik doosrey sey door kar key peshab karney laga. usi Erabi (dehati) (dehaati) Sahaba (Raziallahu anhu) ney Deen ki samajh aa janey key baad (apna waqia bayan kartey huye) farmaya : merey maa baap aap (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) par qurban hon ! aap uth kar merey paas aaye, mujhey na daantaa, na bura bhala kaha, bas ye farmaya : ye masjid aisi jagah hai ke is mein peshab nahin kiya jata, ye to Allah key zikr aur namaz key liye taamir ki gaee hai. phir aap ney pani ka dol talab farmaya jo peshab par baha diya gaya."
"530","Hazrat Waasila Isqaa' (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai unhoney bayan kiya ke eik Erabi (dehati) (dehaati) Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir huwa , usney kaha : aey Allah ! mujh par aur Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) par rehmat farma aur hum par nazil honey wali apni rehmat mein kisi aur ko shareek na karna. aap (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : afsos ! tu ney la-mahdood ko mehdud kar diya. Sahaba kehtey hain : wo ea'raab (dehaati) taangein khol kar peshab karney laga. Sahaba kiram Raziallahu anhum ney kaha : ruk, ruk. Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : usey chhod do. phir pani ka eik dol mangwa kar us jagah baha diya."
"531","Hazrat Ibrahim bin Abdur-Rehman bin Auf ki eik londi sey riwayat hai, unhoney Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ki paak biwi Ummul-mominin Umme-Salma (Raziallahu anha) sey masla puchha aur kaha : main aurat hun, (qamis ka) daman lamba rakhti hun (jo chaltey waqt zamin sey chhuta hai) mera guzar gandi jagah sey bhi hota hai (to kya main daman dhoya karun)? Ummul-mominin (Raziallahu anha) ney kaha , Allah key Rasool (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : usey baad wali (paak) zamin paak kar deti hai."
"532","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke kisi ney arz kiya : aey Allah key Rasool ! hum masjid ki taraf aatey hain to raastey mein napaak jagah par bhi paon padta hai (hum kya keren)? Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : zamin ka eik hissa doosrey hisse (sey hasil honey wali najasat sey jootey ya qadam) ko paak kar deta hai."
"533","qabila banu Abdul-Ash'hal ki eik khatoon (Raziallahu anha) sey riwayat hai, unhoney kaha : mainey Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) sey masla poochha, mainey kaha : merey (ghar) aur masjid key darmiyan raasta gandaa (aur koodey karkat wala) hai. aap (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : uskey baad saaf raasta bhi hai? mainey kaha : ji haan, farmaya : is sey uski bharpaai ho jaeygi."
"534","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Madina ki galiyon mein sey kisi gali mein un ki mulaqat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) sey hui aur wo us waqt junbi (samhog ke bad naapaaki ki haalat mein) they. wo khamoshi sey chaley gaey. Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney un ki adam mojudgi ko mehsus farmaya. jab wo aaye to aap (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : Abu-Hurera ! tum kahan (chaley gaey) they? unhoney kaha : Allah key Rasool ! jab aap mujh sey miley to main junbi (samhog ke bad naapaaki ki haalat mein) tha. mujhey achcha na laga ke nahaaey baghair aap key paas bethun. Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : momin napaak nahin hota."
"535","Hazrat Huzefa (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) sey meri mulaqat hui jabke main haalate janabat (samhog ke bad naapaaki ki haalat mein) mein tha to main aap (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) sey alag ho gaya aur ghusl kiya, phir Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir huwa. aap (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : tumhen kya huwa tha ke mujh sey alag ho gaey? mainey kaha : main junbi (samhog ke bad naapaaki ki haalat mein) tha , Allah key Rasool ney farmaya : yaqinan musalman napaak nahin hota."
"536","Janab Amr bin Memun (Rahimahullah) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : mainey Hazrat Suleman (Alaihissalam) bin Yasar (Rahimahullah) sey sawal kiya ke agar kapdey ko mani lag jaey to kya hum sirf usi hissey ko dho lein ya pura kapda dhoein? Hazrat Suleman (Alaihissalam) (Rahimahullah) ney farmaya : Hazrat Aaysha (Raziallahu anha) ney farmaya : Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) key kapdey ko bhi wo chiz lag jati thi to hum kapdey ko dho kar usey utaar detey they, phir wohi kapda pehan kar namaz padhney tashrif ley jatey, aur mujhey kapdey mein dhoney ka nishan nazar aa raha hota tha."
"537","Humein Hadees bayan ki Ali bin Muhammad ne, sunai Abu Muawiyah ne. Aur humein Hadees bayan ki Muhammad bin Tarif ne, sunai Abda bin Sulaiman ne, sab ne al-A'mash se, Ibraheem (al-Nakhai) se, unhon ne Hammam bin al-Harith se, unhon ne Ayesha se riwayat ki. Unhon ne kaha: \Main kabhi kabhi Rasool Allah ﷺ ke kapde se (Mani ko) apne haath se mal kar nikaal deti thi.\"""""""
"538","Hazrat Hamaam bin Haris (Rahimahullah) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : Hazrat Aaysha (Raziallahu anha) key yahan eik mehman aa gaya. unhoney (raat ko soney key liye) usey eik zard lihaaf dilwa diya. usey ehtilaam ho gaya. (subah key waqt) usey is baat sey sharam mehsus hui ke wo kapda is haal mein (Ummul-mominin key paas) bhejey ke is mein ehtilaam ka nishan ho. usney lihaaf pani mein dubo kar (geelaa kar key)  bhej diya (taake sara lihaaf geelaa honey ki wajeh sey wo nishan nazar na aaye, sirf mutaassira hissey ko dhona kaafi na samjha). Hazrat Aaysha (Raziallahu anha) ney farmaya : usney hamara kapda kyon kharab kar diya? (ab ye itna mota kapda kab khushk hoga?) agar wo usey ungli sey khurch daalta to kafi hota. main bhi baaz oqaat (kabhi kabhi) Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) key kapdey sey ye chiz apni ungli sey khurch diya karti thi."
"539","Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : baaz oqaat mujhey Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) key kapdey par wo chiz nazar aati to main usey khurch kar utaar deti thi."
"540","Hazrat Muawiya bin Abu-Sufiyaan (Raziallahu anhuma) sey riwayat hai ke unhoney apni hamsheera (behan), yani Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ki zauja mutahra (paak biwi) Hazrat Umme-Habiba (Raziallahu anha) sey sawal kiya : kya Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) us kapdey mein namaz padh letey they jis mein sohbat ki hoti? unhoney kaha : haan, agar is mein napaaki ka asar na hota."
"541","Hazrat Abu-Darda (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) (ghar sey) bahar tashrif laye aur aap key sar sey pani tapak raha tha. aap ney eik hi kapda zeb tan (pehan) kar key hamein namaz padhaai jabke aap ney uskey dono kinarey mukhalif simton mein dal rakhey they. jab aap (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) namaz sey farigh huye to umr bin Khattab (Raziallahu anhu) ney arz kiya : aey Allah key Rasool ! aap hamein eik kapda odh kar namaz padha detey hain? farmaya : haan, main is ko pehan kar namaz padh leta hun, agar-che usey pehan kar mubashrat (sambhog) bhi ki ho."
"542","Hazrat Jabir bin Samra (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : eik aadmi ney Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) sey sawal kiya : kisi ney biwi key paas jatey waqt jo kapda pehan rakha ho, kya wohi pehan kar namaz padh sakta hai? aap (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : haan, agar is mein koi chiz nazar aaye (jo dhoney key laaiq ho) to usey dho ley."
"543","Hazrat Hamaam bin Haris sey riwayat hai, unhoney kaha : Hazrat Jareer bin Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) ney peshab kiya. uskey baad wuzu kiya aur mozon par masah kiya. unhein kaha gaya : aap bhi ye kaam kartey hain? farmaya : mujhey kya rukawat hai (mein kyon na karun)? jabke mainey Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ko is tarah kartey dekha hai. Ibrahim ney kaha : logon ko Hazrat Jareer (Raziallahu anhu) ki hadees bahut pasand aai kyonkey wo sura Maeyda key nazil honey key baad Islam laye they."
"544","Humein Hadees bayan ki Muhammad bin Abdullah bin Numair aur Ali bin Muhammad ne, unhon ne kaha sunai Waki' ne. Aur humein Hadees bayan ki Abu Hammad al-Waleed bin Shuja bin al-Waleed ne, sunai mere walid (Shuja) aur Sufyan bin Uyainah aur Ibn Abi Za'idah ne, sab ne al-A'mash se, Abu Wail se, unhon ne Huzaifah se riwayat ki ke Rasool Allah ﷺ ne wuzu kiya aur apne mozon (khuff) par masah kiya."
"545","Hazrat Mughira bin Shoba (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) qazaey-hajat (peshaab-paakhaane) key liye tashrif ley gaey. Hazrat Mughira (Raziallahu anhu) eik bartan mein pani ley kar aap key sath gaey. Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney qazaey-hajat (peshaab-paakhaane) sey farigh ho kar wuzu kiya aur mozon par masah kiya."
"546","Hazrat Abdullah bin umr (Raziallahu anhuma) sey riwayat hai, unhoney Hazrat Saad bin Malik (Raziallahu anhu) ko mozon par masah kartey dekha to farmaya : kya aap log is tarah kartey hain (masah kar letey hain, paon nahin dhotey)? uskey baad Hazrat umr (Raziallahu anhu) key paas dono ki baham (aapas mein) mulaqat ho gaee to Hazrat Saad (Raziallahu anhu) ney Hazrat umr (Raziallahu anhu) sey farmaya : merey bhatijey (ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhuma)) ko mozon par maseh ka masla bata dijiye. Hazrat umr (Raziallahu anhu) ney farmaya : hum log Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) key sath hotey they aur mozon par masah kar liya kartey they, is mein koi harj nahin samajhtey they. Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) ney farmaya : agar-che koi qazaey-hajat (peshaab-paakhaane) sey farigh ho kar aaya ho? umr (Raziallahu anhu) ney farmaya : haan (tab bhi masah kar letey they)."
"547","Humein Hadees bayan ki Abu Mus'ab al-Madani ne, sunai Abdul Muhaimin bin al-Abbas bin Sahl bin Sa'd al-Sa'idi ne, unke walid se, unke dada se ke Rasool Allah ﷺ ne mozon par masah kiya aur humein mozon par masah karne ka hukm diya."
"548","Hazrat Anas bin Malik (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : main eik safar mein Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) key sath tha. aap (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : kuchh pani hai? phir aap ney wuzu kiya aur mozon par masah kiya. phir lashkar sey aa miley aur unhen namaz padhaai."
"549","Humein Hadees bayan ki Ali bin Muhammad ne, sunai Waki' ne, sunai Dalham bin Salih al-Kindi ne, Hujair bin Abdullah al-Kindi se, unhon ne Ibn Buraidah se, unke walid (Buraidah) se riwayat ki ke Najashi ne Nabi ﷺ ko de do sadah (simple) siyah moze (khuff) tohfe mein bheje. Aap ne unhen pehna, phir wuzu kiya aur un par masah kiya."
"550","Humein Hadees bayan ki Hisham bin Ammar ne, sunai al-Waleed bin Muslim ne, sunai Thawr bin Yazid ne, Raja bin Haiwah se, Warrad (jo Mughira bin Shoba ke katib the) se, unhon ne Mughira bin Shoba se riwayat ki ke Rasool Allah ﷺ ne moze ke oopar aur neeche masah kiya."
"551","Hazrat Jabir (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) eik aadmi key paas sey guzrey jo wuzu kar raha tha aur (paaon dhoney key bajaey paon mein pehney huye) mozey dho raha tha. Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney (usey mutawajjeh karney key liye) haath sey usey (halka sa) dhakela aur farmaya : mujhey masah karney ka hukm diya gaya hai.  aur (uski wazahat kartey huye) apney haathon ko (paon ki) ungliyon sey shuru kar key pindli key shuru tak ley gaey aur ungliyon sey (goya) khat kheenchey."
"552","Hazrat Shureh bin Hani (Rahimahullah) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : mainey Hazrat Aaysha (Raziallahu anha) sey mozon par maseh ka masla puchha to unhoney farmaya : Hazrat Ali (Raziallahu anhu) key paas jao kyonkey unhen ye masla mujh sey ziyada malum hai. main Hazrat Ali (Raziallahu anhu) ki khidmat mein hazir huwa aur un sey masah key barey mein daryaft kiya. unhoney farmaya : Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) hamein maseh ka hukm diya kartey they. muqeem key liye eik din raat aur musafir key liye teen din."
"553","Hazrat Khuzaima bin Sabit (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney musafir key liye teen din ki muddat muqarrar farmaai hai, lekin agar saail mazeed muddat key liye ijazat maangta to aap (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) paanch din ki bhi ijazat dey detey."
"554","Humein Hadees bayan ki Muhammad bin Bashar ne, sunai Muhammad bin Jafar ne, sunai Sho'ba ne, Salma bin Kuhail se, unhon ne kaha maine Ibraheem al-Taimi ko bayan karte suna, Haris bin Suwaid se, Amr bin Maimun se, Khuzaima bin Sabit se, Nabi ﷺ ne farmaya: \Teen din — mera khayal hai ke unhon ne kaha — aur teen raatein musafir ke liye mozon par masah karne ki ijazat hai.\"""""""
"555","Humse bayan kiya Abu Bakr bin Abi Shaiba aur Abu Kuraib ne, unhone kaha humse bayan kiya Zaid bin al-Hubab ne, unhone kaha humse bayan kiya Umar bin Abdullah bin Abi Khath'am al-Thumali ne, unhone kaha humse bayan kiya Yahya bin Abi Kathir ne, Abu Salama se, Abu Huraira se, unhone kaha logon ne arz kiya ya Rasool Allah moze par taharat (masah) ki kya had hai? Aap ne farmaya: \Musafir ke liye teen din aur teen raatein hain aur muqeem (ghar par rehne wale) ke liye ek din aur ek raat.\"""""""
"556","Humse bayan kiya Muhammad bin Bashshar aur Bishr bin Hilal al-Sawwaf ne, unhone kaha humse bayan kiya Abdul Wahhab bin Abdul Majeed ne, unhone kaha humse bayan kiya al-Muhajir Abu Makhlad ne, Abdul Rahman bin Abi Bakra se, apne walid se, Nabi (SAW) se ke aap ne musafir ke liye ijazat di ke jab woh wuzu kare aur moze pehne, phir wuzu toot jaye, to teen din aur teen raaton tak masah kar sakta hai aur muqeem ke liye ek din aur ek raat."
"557","Hazrat Ubai-bin Imaara (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai aur ye wo Sahabi hain jinkey ghar mein Allah key Rasool (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney dono qiblon ki taraf munh kar key namaz padhi hai (qibla tabdeel honey ka hukm nazil honey sey pehley Islam laye they). unhoney Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) sey kaha : kya main mozon par masah kar liya karun? aap (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : haan, unhoney kaha : eik din? (phir) kaha : do din? (phir) kaha : teen din? yahan tak key saat din tak ja pahunchey. Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney us sey kaha : jab tak tumhara ji chahey."
"558","Hazrat Aqba bin Aamir Juhni (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke wo Misr sey Hazrat umr (Raziallahu anhu) key paas (Madina Munawwara) aaye. Hazrat umr (Raziallahu anhu) ney puchha : tum ney kitni muddat sey mozey nahin utarey? unhoney kaha : Juma sey Juma tak (hafta bhar) umr (Raziallahu anhu) ney farmaya : tum ney sunnat key mutabiq amal kiya."
"559","Humse bayan kiya Ali bin Muhammad ne, humse bayan kiya Waki' ne, humse bayan kiya Sufyan ne, Abi Qais al-Awdi se, al-Huzail bin Shurahbil se, Mughira bin Shu'ba se, ke Rasool Allah (SAW) ne wuzu kiya aur mozon (jaurabain) aur jooton (na'alain) par masah kiya."
"560","Humse bayan kiya Muhammad bin Yahya ne, humse bayan kiya Mu'alla bin Mansoor aur Bishr bin Adam ne, unhone kaha humse bayan kiya Isa bin Yunus ne, Isa bin Sinan se, al-Dahhak bin Abdul Rahman bin 'Arzab se, Abi Musa al-Ash'ari se, ke Rasool Allah (SAW) ne wuzu kiya aur mozon aur jooton par masah kiya. Mu'alla ne apni hadith mein kaha: \Main nahi jaanta magar unhone kaha: aur jooton par.\"""""""
"561","Humse bayan kiya Hisham bin Ammar ne, humse bayan kiya Isa bin Yunus ne, al-A'mash se, al-Hakam se, Abdul Rahman bin Abi Laila se, Ka'b bin 'Ujra se, Bilal se, ke Rasool Allah (SAW) ne mozon aur amama (khimar) par masah kiya."
"562","Humse bayan kiya Duhaim ne, humse bayan kiya Waleed bin Muslim ne, humse bayan kiya al-Auzai ne, aur (doosri sanad se) humse bayan kiya Abu Bakr bin Abi Shaiba ne, humse bayan kiya Muhammad bin Mus'ab ne, humse bayan kiya al-Auzai ne, humse bayan kiya Yahya bin Abi Kathir ne, humse bayan kiya Abu Salama ne, Ja'far bin Amr se, apne walid se, unhone kaha: Maine Rasool Allah (SAW) ko mozon aur amama par masah karte dekha."
"563","Hazrat Zaid bin Sohaan key azad karda ghulam Hazrat Abu-Muslim (Rahimahullah) sey riwayat hai, wo bayan kartey hain ke main Hazrat Salman (Raziallahu anhu) key sath tha. unhoney eik aadmi ko dekha ke wo wuzu karney key liye mozey utaar raha hai. Salman (Raziallahu anhu) ney us sey farmaya : mozon par, amaamey aur sar key agley hissey par masah kar lo, kyonkey mainey Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ko mozon par aur sar key kapdey par masah kartey dekha hai."
"564","Hazrat Anas bin Malik (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : mainey dekha ke Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney wuzu kya aur aap ney Qatar ka bana huwa amama pehna huwa tha. aap (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney amama key nichey haath dal kar sar key agley hissey ka masah kiya aur amama Mubarak ko khola nahin."
"565","Hazrat Ammar bin Yasir (Raziallahu anhuma) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : Hazrat Aaysha (Raziallahu anha) ka haar gir pada. wo uski talash mein peechey reh gaeen (is wajeh sey qafla bhi ruk gaya). Hazrat Abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) Hazrat Aaysha (Raziallahu anha) key paas gaey aur logon key rukney ka baais bin janey par un par narazi ka izhar farmaya. (chunkey us maqam par wuzu key liye pani mojud nahin tha) chunanche Allah Taala ney tayammum ki ijazat nazil farma di. (Sabab farmatey hain : ) us din hamney kandhon tak masah kiya. (uskey baad) Hazrat abu-Bakar (Raziallahu anhu) Hazrat Aaysha (Raziallahu anha) key paas gaey aur kaha : mujhey malum na tha ke tum is qadr baaise barkat ho."
"566","Humse bayan kiya Muhammad bin Abi Umar al-Adani ne, humse bayan kiya Sufyan bin 'Uyayna ne, Amr se, al-Zuhri se, Ubaidullah bin Abdullah se, apne walid se, Ammar bin Yasir se, unhone kaha: Humne Rasool Allah (SAW) ke saath tayammum kiya (apne haathon ko) moun tak (ya) kandhon tak le gaye."
"567","Humse bayan kiya Yaqub bin Humaid bin Kasib ne, humse bayan kiya Abdul Aziz bin Abi Hazim ne, aur (doosri sanad se) humse bayan kiya Abu Ishaq al-Harawi ne, humse bayan kiya Ismail bin Ja'far ne, sab al-Ala se, apne walid se, Abu Huraira se, ke Rasool Allah (SAW) ne farmaya: \Mere liye zameen ko masjid aur paak karne wala banaya gaya.\"""""""
"568","Hazrat Aaysha (Raziallahu anha) sey riwayat hai ke unhoney Hazrat Asma (Raziallahu anha) sey eik haar aariyatan (udhaar) liya (safar key doran main eik maqam par) wo haar gum ho gaya. Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney chand afrad us ko talash karney key liye bhejey. (us doran mein) namaz ka waqt ho gaya to un afrad ney wuzu kiye baghair namaz padh li. (kyonkey unkey paas pani nahin tha)  jab wo (haar talash kar key) Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir huye to unhoney us chiz ki shikayat ki. tab tayammum ki aayat nazil ho gaee. Hazrat Usaid bin Huzer (Raziallahu anhu) ney farmaya : Allah Taala aap ko jazaae-khair ata farmaaey ! aap par jab bhi koi mushkil aai, Allah Taala ney aap ko to us (mushkil) sey najat dey di aur is mein musalmanon key liye koi barkat inayat farma di."
"569","Hazrat Abdur-Rehman bin Abzaa (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke eik aadmi Hazrat umr bin Khattab (Raziallahu anhu) ki khidmat mein hazir huwa aur kaha : agar mujhey janabat (sambhog ke bad napaaki ki haalat) ki haalat pesh aa jaey aur pani na miley (to kya karun)? Hazrat umr (Raziallahu anhu) ney farmaya : namaz na padh (jab pani milega to ghusl kar key qaza namaz padhna). Hazrat Ammar bin Yasir (Raziallahu anhuma) ney kaha : Ameerul Momineen ! kya aap ko yad nahin jab main aur aap dono eik lashkar mein they. hamen ghusl ki hajat pesh aai aur pani na mila (us waqt bhi) aap ney to namaz nahin padhi thi, mainey zamin par lot pot ho kar namaz padh li thi. phir jab main Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir huwa to ye waqia arz kiya, chunanche aap (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : tujhey to itna hi kafi tha.   aur (ye keh kar) Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney dono haath zamin par maarey, phir un mein phunk maari aur chehrey aur dono hatheliyon par masah kiya."
"570","Hazrat Hukm aur Hazrat Salma bin Kuheil sey riwayat hai ke unhoney Hazrat Abdullah bin Abu Ufaa (Raziallahu anhu) sey tayammum ka masla daryaft kiya, to unhoney farmaya : Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney Hazrat Ammar (Raziallahu anhu) ko is tarah karney ka hukm diya tha. ye keh kar unhoney apney dono haath zamin par maarey, phir unhen jhaada aur unhen apney chehrey par pher liya. Hukm ney kaha : aur apney haathon par pher liya. aur Salma bin Kuheil ney kaha : aur apni kohniyon par pher liya."
"571","Humse bayan kiya Abu al-Tahir Ahmad bin Amr bin al-Sarh al-Misri ne, humse bayan kiya Abdullah bin Wahb ne, humein khabar di Yunus bin Yazid ne, Ibn Shihab se, Ubaidullah bin Abdullah se, Ammar bin Yasir se, us waqt jab unhone Rasool Allah (SAW) ke saath tayammum kiya. Aap ne muslimeen ko hukm diya aur unhone apni hatheli se mitti par maara aur mitti se kuch nahi pakda, phir apne chehre par ek baar masah kiya, phir dubara laut kar apni hatheli se pakki zameen par maara aur apne haathon par masah kiya."
"572","Hazrat Abdullah bin Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) sey riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) key zamaney main eik aadmi ka sar zakhmi ho gaya. uskey baad (eik din) usey ehtilaam ho gaya. (usney Sahaba kiram Raziallahu anhum sey masla poochha)  to usey nahaney ka hukm diya gaya. usney ghusl kiya to (sardi ki shiddat ki wajeh sey) bimar ho gaya aur (usi bimari sey) faut ho gaya. Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ko us waqiey ki ittilaa hui to farmaya : unhoney usey qatl kar diya, Allah unhen halak karey. kya poochh lena la-ilmi ka ilaj nahin? Hazrat Ata (Rahimahullah) ney farmaya : hamein riwayat pahunchi hai ke Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya tha : kaash! wo baqi jism dho leta aur sar ko rehney deta jahan usey zakham tha."
"573","Ummul-mominin Memuna (Raziallahu anha) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : mainey Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) key liye ghusl ka pani rakha to aap ney ghusle-janabat (samhog ke bad napaaki ki halat ka ghusl) kiya (pehley) baaein hath sey bartan ko jhuka kar daain haath par pani dala aur teen baar apney dono haath dhoey. phir apni sharmgah par pani dala (aur istinja kiya), phir zamin par haath ragdaa (aur saaf kar liya) phir kulli ki aur naak mein pani dala. teen baar Chehra Mubarak dhoya, aur teen baar bazu dhoey. phir baqi jism par pani baha liya. phir eik taraf ho kar dono paon dho liye."
"574","Hazrat Jamee bin Umer Taimi (Rahimahullah) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : main apni phuphi jaan aur khaala jaan key sath gaya. hum Hazrat Aaysha (Raziallahu anha) ki khidmat mein hazir huye aur un sey puchha : Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ghusle-janabat (samhog ke bad napaaki ki halat ka ghusl) key moqey par kiya tariqa ikhtiyar kartey they? unhoney farmaya : aap (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) teen baar haathon par pani daltey they, uskey baad pani key bartan mein haath daltey , phir teen baar apna sar Mubarak dhotey , phir apney jism Mubarak par pani bahaatey. uskey baad namaz key liye tashrif ley jatey. lekin hum baal ghundhey huye honey ki wajeh sey paanch baar sar dhoti hain."
"575","Hazrat Juber bin Mut-im (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ki majlis mein ghusle-janabat (samhog ke bad napaaki ki halat ka ghusl) key barey mein behes ho gaee to Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : main to apney sar par teen lap (pani) daalta hun."
"576","Hazrat Abu-Saeed (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke eik aadmi ney un sey ghusle-janabat (samhog ke bad napaaki ki halat ka ghusl) key barey mein sawal kiya to unhoney farmaya : teen (lap pani sar par dalo). us shakhs ney kaha : merey baal bahut ziyada hain. Hazrat Abu-Saeed (Raziallahu anhu) ney farmaya : Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) key baal tum sey ziyada they, aur wo tum sey ziyada pakizah they."
"577","Hazrat Jabir (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : mainey arz kiya : aey Allah key Rasool ! main sard ilaqey mein rehta hun to ghusle-janabat (samhog ke bad napaaki ki halat ka ghusl) kaisey karun? aap (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : main to apney sar par teen lap daalta hun."
"578","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke un sey eik aadmi ney sawal kiya : jab main junbi (samhog ke bad napaaki ki halat mein) hun to (ghusl kartey waqt) sar par kitna pani dala karun? Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ney farmaya : Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) apney sar Mubarak par teen lap (pani) dala kartey they. us shakhs ney kaha : merey baal lambey hain. Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ney farmaya : Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) key baal tujh sey ziyada they : aur ziyada pakizah they."
"579","Humse bayan kiya Abu Bakr bin Abi Shaiba aur Abdullah bin Amir bin Zurara aur Ismail bin Musa al-Suddi ne, unhone kaha humse bayan kiya Shareek ne, Abi Ishaq se, al-Aswad se, Aisha se, unhone kaha: \Rasool Allah (SAW) janabat ke ghusl ke baad wuzu nahi karte the.\"""""""
"580","Hazrat Aaysha (Raziallahu anha) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ghusle-janabat (samhog ke bad napaaki ki halat ka ghusl) kartey they, phir merey ghusl karney sey pehley mujh sey (lipat kar) garmi hasil kartey they."
"581","Hazrat Aaysha (Raziallahu anha) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ko janabat(samhog ke bad napaaki ki halat) ki keyfiyat pesh aati thi, phir aap pani ko haath lagaey baghair so jatey they yahan tak key baad mein uth kar ghusl farma letey."
"582","Hazrat Aaysha (Raziallahu anha) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) agar apni ehal (ghar-wali) sey qurbat ki zarurat mehsus farmatey to apni ye hajat puri kar letey, phir pani ko haath lagaey baghair usi haalat mein so jatey."
"583","Hazrat Aaysha (Raziallahu anha) sey riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) junbi (samhog ke bad napaaki ki halat mein) hotey they, to pani ko haath lagaey baghair usi haalat mein so jatey they. Sufiyan kehtey hain ke eik din mainey is hadees ka zikr kiya to Ismail ney farmaya : ladkey ! is hadees ko kisi chiz sey mazbut karney ki zarurat hai."
"584","Hazrat Aaysha (Raziallahu anha) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ko jab nahaney ki hajat hoti aur aap (nahaaey baghair) sona chahtey to namaz wala wuzu kar letey they."
"585","Hazrat Abdullah bin umr (Raziallahu anhuma) sey riwayat hai ke Hazrat umr bin Khattab (Raziallahu anhu) ney Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) sey arz kiya : jab hum mein sey koi shakhs haalate janabat (samhog ke bad napaaki ki halat mein) mein ho to kya wo so sakta hai? aap ney farmaya : haan, jab wuzu kar ley (to so jaey)."
"586","Humse bayan kiya Abu Marwan al-Uthmani Muhammad bin Uthman ne, humse bayan kiya Abdul Aziz bin Muhammad ne, Yazid bin Abdullah bin al-Had se, Abdullah bin Khabbab se, Abi Sa'eed al-Khudri se, ke unhein raat ko janabat lagti thi aur woh sona chahte the, to Rasool Allah (SAW) ne unhein hukm diya ke wuzu karein phir soyein."
"587","Humse bayan kiya Muhammad bin Abdul Malik bin Abi al-Shawarib ne, humse bayan kiya Abdul Wahid bin Ziyad ne, humse bayan kiya Asim al-Ahwal ne, Abi al-Mutawakkil se, Abi Sa'eed al-Khudri se, unhone kaha: Rasool Allah (SAW) ne farmaya: \Jab tum mein se koi apni biwi se milay (jimaa kare)"","" phir dubara karna chaahe to wuzu kare.\"""""""
"588","Humse bayan kiya Muhammad bin al-Muthanna Abu Musa ne, humse bayan kiya Abdul Rahman bin Mahdi aur Abu Ahmad ne, Sufyan se, Ma'mar se, Qatada se, Anas se, ke Nabi (SAW) apni biwiyon ke paas ek hi ghusl mein chakkar lagate the (yani ek ghusl se sab se milte the)."
"589","Hazrat Anas (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : mainey Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) key liye pani rakha, to aap ney eik hi raat mein tamam azwaaje-mutah'raat (paak biwiyon) Raziallahu anhu  sey muqaribat key baad (eik hi baar) ghusl kiya."
"590","Hazrat abu-Raafey (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) eik raat tamam azwaje-mutahrat (paak biwiyon) Raziallahu anhu key paas gaey. aap un mein sey har eik key ghar mein ghusl kartey rahey. kisi ney arz kiya : aey Allah key Rasool ! aap eik hi ghusl kyon nahin kar letey? aap (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : is (tareeqey) mein safai, pakizgi aur tahaarat ziyada hai."
"591","Hazrat Aaysha (Raziallahu anha) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ko jab ghusl ki hajat hoti aur (usi doran mein) aap kuchh tanaawul farmana (khaana) chahtey to (khaney sey pehley) wuzu kar letey."
"592","Hazrat Jabir bin Abdullah (Raziallahu anhuma) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) sey junbi (samhog ke bad napaaki ki halat mein insan) key mutalliq sawal kiya gaya : kya wo so sakta hai ya kha pi sakta hai? aap (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : haan , jab wuzu kar ley, jis tarah namaz key liye wuzu hota hai."
"593","Hazrat Aaysha (Raziallahu anha) sey riwayat hai ke jab Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) (haalate-janabat (samhog ke bad napaaki) mein) ghusl karney sey pehley (kuchh tanaawul farmana (khaana) chahtey to apney haath dho letey."
"594","Hazrat Abdullah bin Salma (Rahimahullah) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : main Hazrat Ali bin Abu-Talib (Raziallahu anhu) ki khidmat mein hazir huwa. unhoney (masaayel bayan kartey huye) farmaya : Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) baitul-khalaa mein jatey, qazaey-hajat (peshaab-paakhaane) sey farigh ho kar bahar tashrif latey to hamarey sath roti gosht bhi tanaawul farmatey aur Quran ki tilawat bhi kartey. aap (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ko janabat key siwa koi chiz Quran (ki tilawat) sey rukawat nahin hoti thi."
"595","Hazrat Abdullah bin umr (Raziallahu anhuma) sey riwayat hai, Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : junbi (samhog ke bad napaaki ki halat mein insan) aur haaiza Quran na padhein."
"596","Abu al-Hasan ne kaha, aur humse bayan kiya Abu Hatim ne, humse bayan kiya Hisham bin Ammar ne, humse bayan kiya Ismail bin Ayyash ne, humse bayan kiya Musa bin Uqba ne, Nafi se, Ibn Umar se, unhone kaha: Rasool Allah (SAW) ne farmaya: \Janubi aur haiz wali (aurat) Quran mein se kuch nahi parhein.\"""""""
"597","Humse bayan kiya Nasr bin Ali al-Jahdami ne, humse bayan kiya al-Harith bin Wajih ne, humse bayan kiya Malik bin Dinar ne, Muhammad bin Sirin se, Abu Huraira se, unhone kaha: Rasool Allah (SAW) ne farmaya: \Beshar har baal ke neeche janabat hai"","" to baal dho’o aur jild (khaal) ko saaf karo.\"""""""
"598","Hazrat Abu-Ayyub Ansari (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : paanchon namaazein, Juma doosrey Jumey tak aur amanat ki adaegi unkey darmiyani gunahon ka kaffara hai. mainey arz kiya : amanat ki adaegi sey kya murad hai? farmaya : janabat (samhog ke bad napaaki ki halat mein insan) ka ghusl kyonkey har baal key nichey janabat (samhog ke bad ki napaaki) hai."
"599","Hazrat Ali (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : jisney ghusle-janabat (samhog ke bad napaaki ki halat ke ghusl) mein jism ki baal barabar jagah bhi chhod di aur usey na dhoya, usey aag ka itna itna (bahut ziyada) azab diya jaeyga. Hazrat Ali (Raziallahu anhu) ney farmaya : isi wajeh sey mainey apney baalon sey dushmani ikhtiyar kar li. aap sar key baal kaat diya kartey they."
"600","Hazrat Ummul-mominin Umme-Salma (Raziallahu anha) sey riwayat hai ke Hazrat Umme Sulem (Raziallahu anha) Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir huin aur masla puchha ke agar aurat ko khuwab mein wo kuchh nazar aaye jo mard ko nazar aata hai (to uska kya hukm hai)? aap (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : haan, jab usey pani nazar aaye to usey ghusl karna chahiye. (Ummul-mominin ney farmaya) mainey kaha : (aey Umme Sulem ! ) tum ney aurton ko ruswa kar diya hai, bhala aurat ko bhi ehtilaam hota hai? Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : tera bhala ho ! phir uski aulad us sey mushabeh kyon hoti hai?"
"601","Hazrat Anas (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Hazrat Umme Sulem (Raziallahu anha) ney Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) sey us aurat key barey mein sawal kiya jisey khuwab mein wo chiz nazar aaye jo mard ko nazar aaya karti hai? to Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : jab usey ye chiz nazar aaye aur usey inzaal ho jaey (paani nikal jaey) to is par ghusl karna wajib hai. Hazrat Umme-Salma (Raziallahu anha) ney farmaya : aey Allah key Rasool ! kya aisey bhi ho jata hai? aap (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : haan, mard ka pani gaadhaa aur safed hota hai aur aurat ka pani patla aur zard hota hai. un dono mein sey jo bhi sabqat (badhat) ley jaey ya ghalib aa jaey, bacha us sey mushabeh (us par shakl mein) hota hai."
"602","Hazrat Khaula binte Hakeem (Raziallahu anha) sey riwayat hai, unhoney Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) sey masla puchha ke agar aurat khuwab mein wohi dekhey jo kuchh mard dekhta hai? to aap (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya is par ghusl farz nahin jab tak usey inzaal (paani ka nikalna) na ho. jis tarah mard par ghusl wajib nahin jab tak usey inzaal (paani ka nikalna) na ho."
"603","Hazrat Umme-Salma (Raziallahu anha) sey riwayat hai, unhoney bayan kiya, ke mainey kaha : aey Allah key Rasool ! main sar key baalon ki mendhiyan mazbooti sey banati hun, to kya ghusle-janabat (samhog ke bad napaaki ki halat ke ghusl) key liye unhen khola karun? aap (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : tujhey yehi kafi hai ke sar par pani ki teen lappein dal ley, phir apney (purey jism) par pani baha ley, to paak ho jaaeygi. ya farmaya : bas to pak ho gaee."
"604","Hazrat Ubaid bin Umer (Rahimahullah) sey riwayat hai, unhoney kaha : Hazrat Aaysha (Raziallahu anha) ko malum huwa ke Hazrat Abdullah bin Amr (Raziallahu anhuma) apni khawatin ko hukm detey hain ke jab wo ghusl karen to sar (ki mendhiyan waghera) khol liya karen. Ummul-mominin ney farmaya : Abdullah bin Amr par tajjub hai ! (ke wo aurton ko ghusl key liye baal kholney ka hukm detey hain) wo unhen ye hukm kyon nahin dey detey ke apney sar mundwaa diya karen. main aur Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) eik hi bartan mein ghusl kartey they, main to is sey ziyada nahin karti thi ke sar par teen baar pani dal leti thi. (Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) mujhey baal kholney ka hukm nahin detey they.)"
"605","Hazrat Hisham bin Zohra key azad karda ghulam Hazrat abu-Saaib (Rahimahullah) sey riwayat hai, unhoney Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey suna ke Allah key Rasool (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : jab koi shakhs junbi (samhog ke bad napaaki ki halat mein insan) ho to thehrey huye pani mein ghusl na karey. Abu-Saaib ney kaha : aey Abu-Hurera ! phir wo kya karey? Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ney farmaya : kisi chiz mein pani ley kar ghusl kar ley."
"606","Hazrat Abu-Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) eik Ansari Sahaba key paas gaey aur usey bulwaayaa. wo (ghar sey) nikla to uskey sar sey pani key qatrey tapak rahey they. chunanche aap (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : shayad hamney tujhey jaldi mein dal diya? usney kaha : ji haan, aey Allah key Rasool ! aap ney farmaya : jab tujhey (kisi wajeh sey) jaldi pad jaey (aur tujhey farigh honey sey pehley peechhey hatna padey) ya tujhey inzaal (iskhalan) na ho to tujh par ghusl farz nahin, sirf wuzu karna zaruri hai."
"607","Humse bayan kiya Muhammad bin al-Sabbah ne, humse bayan kiya Sufyan bin 'Uyayna ne, Amr bin Dinar se, Ibn al-Sa'ib se, Abdul Rahman bin Su'ad se, Abi Ayyub se, unhone kaha: Rasool Allah (SAW) ne farmaya: \Pani pani se hai (yani ghusl tab wajib hai jab pani (mani) nikaley).\"""""""
"608","Humse bayan kiya Ali bin Muhammad al-Tanafisi aur Abdul Rahman bin Ibrahim al-Dimashqi ne, unhone kaha humse bayan kiya al-Waleed bin Muslim ne, humse bayan kiya al-Auzai ne, humein khabar di Abdul Rahman bin al-Qasim ne, humein khabar di al-Qasim bin Muhammad ne, Aisha, Nabi (SAW) ki biwi se, unhone kaha: \Jab do khatan (sharmgah) mil jayein to ghusl wajib ho jata hai; maine aur Rasool Allah (SAW) ne aisa kiya"","" to humne ghusl kiya.\"""""""
"609","Hazrat Ubai-bin Kaab (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : Islam key ibtidaai daur mein rukhsat (chhoot) thi (ke jima (sambhog) ki surat mein jab tak inzaal (iskhalan) na ho, ghusl wajib nahin hota tha). baad mein hamein ghusl karney ka hukm dey diya gaya."
"610","Humse bayan kiya Abu Bakr bin Abi Shaiba ne, humse bayan kiya al-Fadl bin Dukain ne, Hisham al-Dastawa'i se, Qatada se, al-Hasan se, Abi Rafi se, Abu Huraira se, Rasool Allah (SAW) se, aap ne farmaya: \Jab aadmi uske (biwi ke) chaar hisson (dono pair aur dono haath) ke beech baithe"","" phir us se jima kare"","" to ghusl wajib ho gaya.\"""""""
"611","Hazrat Abdullah bin Amr (Raziallahu anhuma) sey riwayat hai, Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : jab khatney baham (aapas mein) mil jaeyn aur supari chhup jaey to ghusl wajib ho jata hai."
"612","Hazrat Aaysha (Raziallahu anha) sey riwayat hai, Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : jab koi shakhs neend sey bedaar ho aur usey (jism ya kapdon par) geelaa pan  (mani) nazar aaye aur usey khuwab yad na ho, wo ghusl karey aur agar usey mehsus ho ke usney khuwab (mein ghusl wajib karney wala amal) dekha hai aur (bedaar honey par) geelaa pan nazar na aaye to is par koi ghusl nahin."
"613","Humse bayan kiya al-Abbas bin Abdul Azim al-Anbari aur Abu Hafs Amr bin Ali al-Fallas aur Mujahid bin Musa ne, unhone kaha humse bayan kiya Abdul Rahman bin Mahdi ne, humse bayan kiya Yahya bin al-Waleed ne, mujhe khabar di Muhill bin Khalifa ne, mujhe bayan kiya Abu al-Samh ne, unhone kaha: \Main Nabi (SAW) ki khidmat karta tha"","" jab aap ghusl karna chahte to farmate: 'Meri taraf peeṭh karo.' To main apni pusht aap ki taraf kar deta aur kapra phaila kar aap ko chhupa leta.\"""""""
"614","Hazrat Abdullah bin Naufal sey riwayat hai, unhoney kaha : mainey (Sahaba kiram sey) sawal kiya ke Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney safar mein nafl padhey hain? koi shakhs mujhey (ye masla) bataaney wala na mila . aakhir mujhey Umme-Haani binte Abu-Talib (Raziallahu anha) ney bataya ke Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) Fateh Makka key saal (Makka Mukarrma) tashrif laye. aap ney hukm diya to aap par parda kiya gaya, chunanche aap ney ghusl kiya phir aath rakat nafl ada kiye."
"615","Humse bayan kiya Muhammad bin Ubaid bin Tha'laba al-Himmani ne, humse bayan kiya Abdul Hameed Abu Yahya al-Himmani ne, humse bayan kiya al-Hasan bin Umara ne, al-Minhaj bin Amr se, Abi Ubaida se, Abdullah bin Mas'ood se, unhone kaha: Rasool Allah (SAW) ne farmaya: \Tum mein se koi khule maidan mein ya aisi chhat par jahan woh chhupa na ho"","" ghusl na kare. Agar woh nahi dekh sakta to woh dekha jaa sakta hai.\"""""""
"616","Hazrat Abdullah bin Arqam (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : jab koi shakhs qazaey-hajat (peshaab-paakhaane) key liye jana chahta ho aur namaz khadi ho jaey to usey chahiye ke pehley hajat sey faraaghat hasil karey."
"617","Hazrat Abu-Umama (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, Rasoolullah ney is baat sey mana farmaya ke aadmi peshab rokey huye namaz padhey."
"618","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : koi shakhs us haal mein namaz key liye khada na ho ke usey peshab ya pakhane ki hajat ho."
"619","Hazrat Soban (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : koi musalman peshab ya pakhane ki hajat hotey huye (namaz key liye) khada na ho yahan tak key halka phulka ho jaaey (hajat sey farigh ho jaey)."
"620","Hazrat Fatima binte Abu Habish (Raziallahu anha) sey riwayat hai, unhoney Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir ho kar khoon (jari rehney) ki shikayat ki. Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : ye to eik rag hai, tum khayal rakha karo, jab tumhara haiz shuru ho jaaey to namaz na padho. jab haiz khatam ho jaey to ghusl kar lo, phir haiz (key khatam honey sey haiz) key shuru honey tak namaz ada karo."
"621","Hazrat Aaysha (Raziallahu anha) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : Hazrat Fatima binte Abu Habish (Raziallahu anha) Allah key Rasool (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir huin aur kaha : aey Allah key Rasool ! mujhey istihaza ki shikayat hai, main to paak hi nahin hoti. to kya main namaz ko(bilkul) chhod dun? aap (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : nahin, ye to eik rag hai, ye haiz nahin. jab haiz aaye to namaz padhna chhod dey, jab khatam ho jaey to apney jism sey khoon ko dho dal aur (ghusl kar key) namaz ada kar. ye hadees Wakee ki hai."
"622","Hazrat Umme-Habiba binte Jahash (Raziallahu anha) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : mujhey taweel arsey tak ba-kasrat istihaza aata raha tha. main Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir hui taake aap ko (apni kaifiyat) bata kar masla malum karun. mujhey apni behan Zenab (Raziallahu anha) key ghar Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) mil gaey. mainey arz kiya : Allah key Rasool ! mujhey aap sey eik kaam hai. aap ney farmaya : aey khatoon ! kya kaam hai? mainey kaha : mujhey taweel arsey tak b-kasrat istihaza aata rehta hai jiski wajeh sey main namaz, roza ada nahin kar sakti, to aap mujhey kya hukm detey hain? aap (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : main terey liye rui tajwiz karta hun, kyonkey wo khoon ko jazb kar leti hai. mainey kaha : wo to us sey ziyada hai. padhi. uskey baad Raavi ney puri hadees Shareek ki hadees ki tarah bayan ki."
"623","Hazrat Umme-Salma (Raziallahu anha) sey riwayat hai, unhoney kaha : eik aurat ney Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) sey sawal kiya, usney kaha : mujhey istihaza aata hai to main pak hi nahin hoti. to kya main namaz chhod dun? Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : nahin jitney din raat tujhey (bimari shuru honey sey pehley har maah) haiz aaya karta tha itney arse tak (namaz) chhod diya kar. Abu-Bakar (bin Abu Sahiba) ki eik riwayat mein yun hai : is miqdaar key mutabiq mahiney mein sey, uskey baad ghusl kar ley aur langot baandh ley phir namaz padh ley."
"624","Hazrat Aaysha (Raziallahu anha) sey riwayat hai, unhoney kaha : Hazrat Fatima binte Abu Habeesh (Raziallahu anha) Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir huin aur arz kiya : aey Allah key Rasool ! mujhey istihaza ki shikayat hai, isliye main pak nahin hoti , to kya main namaz chhod dun? aap (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : nahin, wo to (bimari ki) eik rag hai. ye haiz (ka khoon) nahin. haiz key dinon (dinon) mein namaz sey ijtinab (bacha) kar, iskey baad ghusl kar ley aur har namaz key liye wuzu kar liya kar, agar-che chataai par khoon tapakta rahey."
"625","Hazrat Adi bin Sabit Ansari (Rahimahullah) apney walid sey, aur wo Adi key nana Hazrat Abdullah bin Yazeed Khutmi (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat kartey hain ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : istihaza wali aurat haiz key dinon (dinon) mein namaz chhod dey, phir ghusl kar ley aur har namaz key liye wuzu karey aur rozey bhi rakhey, namaz bhi padhey."
"626","Hazrat Aaysha (Raziallahu anha) sey riwayat hai, unhoney kaha : Hazrat Umme-Habiba binte Jahash (Raziallahu anha) jo Hazrat Abdur-Rehman bin Auf (Raziallahu anhu) ki ehliya thin, saat saal istihaza ki bimari mein mubtala rahin. (aakhir kaar) unhoney Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) sey shikayat ki to aap (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : ye haiz nahin, ye to (bimari ki) eik rag hai. jab haiz aaye to namaz chhod dey aur jab khatam ho jaey to ghusl kar key namaz padh. Hazrat Aaysha (Raziallahu anha) ney farmaya : chunanche wo har namaz key liye ghusl kiya karti thin. wo apni behan (Ummul-momenin) Zenab binte Jahash (Raziallahu anha) key tab mein (pani dal kar ghusl key liye) beth jatin yahan tak key khoon ki surkhi pani par aa jati."
"627","Hazrat Hamna binte Jahash (Raziallahu anha) sey riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) key zamaney mein unhen istihazey ki bimari thi. unhoney Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir ho kar arz kiya : mujhey bahut buri tarah shadeed istihaza aata hai. aap (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : rui rakh liya karo . unhoney kaha : wo to us sey ziyada shadeed hai. wo to behta hi chala jata hai. aap (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : langot baandh liya karo aur Allah key ilm par aitimad kar key har mahiney chhe saat din haiz shumar kar lo. phir ghusl kar lo aur teyis-chaubees din namaz roza ada karo. Zohar ko der sey aur Asr ko jaldi padh lo, aur un dono (namazon) key liye eik baar ghusl kar liya karo . (isi tarah) maghrib ki namaz der sey aur Isha ki namaz jaldi padh liya karo, aur in dono key liye eik baar ghusl karo aur ye tariqa mujhey ziyada pasand hai."
"628","Hazrat Umme Qais binte Mohsin (Raziallahu anha) sey riwayat hai, unhoney kaha : mainey Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) sey kapdey ko haiz ka khoon lag janey ka masla poochha. aap (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : usey beeri key patton aur pani key sath dho dalo, aur usey khurch do, chahey lakdi sey khurcho."
"629","Hazrat Asma binte Abu-Bakar Siddiq (Raziallahu anha) sey riwayat hai, unhoney kaha : Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) sey kapdey ko lag janey waley haiz key khoon key barey mein sawal kiya gaya to aap ney farmaya : ungliyon sey mal kar dho ley aur usey pehan kar namaz padh ley."
"630","Ummul-mominin Hazrat Aaysha (Raziallahu anha) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : hum mein sey kisi ko haiz aata tha to pak honey par wo ungliyon sey mal kar kapdey sey khoon utaar deti thi, phir (wahan sey) kapda dho leti, aur baqi kapdey par chheentey maar leti aur usey pehan kar namaz padh leti thi."
"631","Hazrat Muaaza Adwiya(Reh. Aleh.) sey riwayat hai ke Hazrat Aaysha (Raziallahu anha) sey eik aurat ney sawal kiya : kya haiz wali aurat namaz ki qaza degi? Hazrat Aaysha (Raziallahu anha) ney us sey kaha : kya to haroori (khaariji) hai? hamein Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ki mojudgi mein haiz aata tha, phir hum pak ho jati thin, to aap (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney hamein (kabhi) namaz ki qaza deney ka hukm nahin farmaya."
"632","Hazrat Aaysha (Raziallahu anha) sey riwayat hai, unhoney kaha : Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney mujh sey farmaya : mujhey masjid mein sey musalla (jaey-namaz) utha do. mainey arz kiya : main haiz sey hun. Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : tumhara haiz tumharey haath main to nahin hai."
"633","Hazrat Aaysha (Raziallahu anha) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) masjid mein aetikaf bethey huye they aur main haiz sey hoti thi to aap apna sar Mubarak merey qarib kar detey chunanche main sar dho deti aur kanghi kar deti thi."
"634","Hazrat Aaysha (Raziallahu anha) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) meri god mein sar rakh kar Quran Majeed ki tilawat kar letey they, jabke main haiz sey hoti thi."
"635","Hazrat Aaysha (Raziallahu anha) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : hum (Ummehaatul Momeneen) mein sey koi jab khas dinon (haaiz) mein hoti to khoon ki shiddat aur kasrat key dinon (din) mein bhi Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) usey izaar baandhney ko kehtey, phir us sey mubashrat farmatey (jism key sath jism mila kar let jatey) (lekin) tum mein sey kisi ko apni khahish par itna qabu hai jitna qabu Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ko apni khahish par hasil tha?"
"636","Hazrat Aaysha (Raziallahu anha) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : hum (Ummehaatul Momeneen) mein sey koi jab dinon (haiz) sey hoti to Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) usey teh band baandh leney ka hukm detey, phir us sey mubashrat (boss aur kinaar) farmatey."
"637","Ummul-mominin Hazrat Umme-Salma (Raziallahu anha) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : main Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) key sath aap key lihaaf mein (leti hui) thi, mujhey haiz shuru honey ka ehsas huwa. jis tarah aurton ko hota hai. main aahisatagi key sath lihaaf sey nikal gaee, Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : kya tumhen khoon aa gaya hai? mainey kaha : mujhey haiz ki wo kaifiyat mehsus hui hai jo aurton ko hoti hai. aap ney farmaya : ye chiz to Allah ney Adam ki betiyon par likh di hai. Ummul-mominin ney farmaya : main khamoshi sey uth gaee aur apni haalat ko durust kiya. phir wapis aai to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney mujh sey farmaya : lihaaf mein merey paas aa jao. unhoney kaha chunanche mainey bhi aap key sath lihaaf ley liya."
"638","Hazrat Muawiya bin Abu-Sufiyaan (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke mainey Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ki zauja mohtarma (biwi) (aur apni hamsheera (bahan)) Hazrat Umme-Habiba (Raziallahu anha) sey sawal kiya : aap ka haiz ke dinon mein Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) key sath uthna bethna kis tarah hota tha? unhoney farmaya : jab hum (azwaaje mutah'raat (paak biwiyon)) mein sey kisi ko haiz shuru hota to wo nisf (aadhi) raanon tak chadar lapet leti, phir Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) key sath let jati."
"639","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhuma) sey riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : jisney haiz wali aurat sey mubashrat (sohbat) ki, ya aurat ki peeth mein mubashrat (sohbat) ki, ya kisi kaahin key paas gaya (aur us sey ghaibi maamlat key barey mein kuchh poochha) aur uski kahi hui baat ko sach maan liya to usney Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) par nazil ki janey wali chiz key sath kufr kiya."
"640","Hazrat Abdullah bin Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) sey riwayat hai ke haiz ke dinon mein aurat sey mubashrat karney waley key barey mein Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : wo eik Dinar ya nisf (aadha) Dinar sadqa dey."
"641","Hazrat Aaysha (Raziallahu anha) sey riwayat hai ke wo haiz sey farigh huin to Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : apney baal khol do aur ghusl karo. Ali bin Muhammad ki riwayat mein hai : apna sar khol do."
"642","Hazrat Aaysha (Raziallahu anha) sey riwayat hai ke Hazrat Asma (binte Shakal Ansaariya (Raziallahu anha)) ney Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) sey haiz key ghusl key barey mein masla puchha to aap ney farmaya : aurat ko chahiye ke pani aur beeri key pattey ley ley, phir safai karey aur achchhi tarah safai karey. ya farmaya : bahut ziyada safai karey (jism ko khub saaf karey), phir sar par pani dal kar khub maley yahan tak key pani baalon ki jadon tak pahunch jaaey. phir sarey badan par pani bahaaey phir rui ka khushbudar phohaa ley kar us sey tahaarat kerey. Hazrat Asma (Raziallahu anha) ney kaha : main uskey sath kaisey tahaarat hasil karun? aap (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : Subhan Allah ! uskey sath tahaarat karo. Hazrat Aaysha (Raziallahu anha) ney aahista sey kaha is ko khoon key maqam par laga. Hazrat Asma (Raziallahu anha) bayan karti hain : mainey Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) sey ghusle-janabat (sambhog ke bad napaki ke ghusl) key barey mein puchha to aap ney farmaya : aurat ko chahiye ke pani ley, phir safai karey aur achi tarah safai kerey. ya farmaya : bahut ziyada safai kerey. phir sar par pani dal kar maley yahan tak key pani baalon ki jadon tak pahunch jaey. phir apney jism par pani baha ley. Hazrat Aaysha (Raziallahu anha) ney farmaya : ansaar ki aurten bhi bahut achchhi aurten thin. unhein Deen key masaayel seekhney sey haya rukawat nahin hoti thi."
"643","Hazrat Aaysha (Raziallahu anha) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : main haiz ke dinon mein hoti thi to (baaz oqaat aisa bhi hota tha ke) main haddi wali boti sey daanton key sath gosht nochti to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) us (boti) ko ley letey aur jahan mainey munh lagaya tha, wahin sey munh laga kar us haddi sey gosht nochte, main bartan mein pani peeti to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) wahin munh rakh (kar pani pi) letey jahan mainey munh rakha hota tha."
"644","Hazrat Anas (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Yahudi ghar mein haaiza aurat key paas nahin bethtey they, na (uskey sath mil kar) khatey peetey they. Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) sey is baat ka zikr kiya gaya (aur masla daryaft kiya gaya) to Allah Taala ney ye aayat nazil farma di : (وَيَسْأَلُونَكَ عَنْ الْمَحِيضِ قُلْ هُوَ أَذًى فَاعْتَزِلُوا النِّسَاءَ فِي الْمَحِيضِ) \aur aap sey haiz key barey mein poochhtey hain"","" farma dijiye"","" wo gandagi hai"","" so tum haiz (key dinon) mein aurton sey alag raho. (iski wazahat kartey huye) Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : tum jima (sambhog) key siwa sab kuchh kar saktey ho."""""
"645","Hazrat Umme-Salma (Raziallahu anha) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) us masjid key sehan mein dakhil huye aur buland aawaz sey aelan farmaya : kisi junbi (samhog ke bad napaaki ki halat mein insan) ya haaiza ko masjid mein dakhil hona jayez nahin."
"646","Hazrat Aaysha (Raziallahu anha) sey riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney us aurat key barey mein, jisey pak honey key baad koi mashkook (shak wali) chiz nazar aaye, farmaya : wo eik rag hai. 'ya farmaya : wo ragein hain. Muhammad bin Yahyaa ney kaha : pak honey key baad sey murad ghusl key baad hai."
"647","Hazrat Umme Atiya (Raziallahu anha) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : hum zard aur matyaley pani ko kuchh nahin samajhti thin. Imam Ibne-Maja (Rahimahullah) ney kaha , hamein Muhammad bin Yahyaa ney Muhammad bin Abdullah Raqaashi sey ba-wasta Wuhaib an Ayub, Hazrat Umme Atiya sey bayan kiya, unhoney kaha : hum zard aur matyaley pani ko kuch nahin samajhti thin. Muhammad bin Yahyaa ney kaha is hadees ko bayan karney mein wuhaib hamarey nazdik (Maamar sey) ziyada qabile aitimad hain."
"648","Hazrat Umme-Salma (Raziallahu anha) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) key zamanae Mubarak mein nifaas wali aurat chaalis din bethi rehti thi, aur hum chhaiyon ka ilaj karney key liye chehron par waras lagaati thin."
"649","Hazrat Anas (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney nifaas wali aurat key liye chaalis din ki miqdaar muqarrar ki hai, siwaye uskey ke us muddat sey pehley tuhur (paaki) nazar aa jaey."
"650","Hazrat Abdullah bin Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : jab koi shakhs haiz ki haalat mein biwi sey mubashrat (sohbat) kar leta to Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) usey aadha Dinar sadqa karney ka hukm detey they."
"651","Hazrat Abdullah bin Saad (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, unhoney kaha : mainey Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) sey haaiza key sath mil kar khana khaney ka hukm daryaft kiya to aap (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : uskey sath mil kar kha liya karo."
"652","Hazrat Aaysha (Raziallahu anha) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) namaz padh rahey they aur main aap key qarib (leti hui) thi jabke main haiz sey thi. mainey eik chadar apney ooper ley rakhi thi aur uska eik hissa aap (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) key jism Mubarak par tha."
"653","Ummul-mominin Hazrat Memuna (Raziallahu anha) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney (ghar mein nafl) namaz padhi . aap ney chadar odh rakhi thi jis ka kuchh hissa Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) par tha aur kuchh hissa un par tha. aur wo haalate haiz mein thin."
"654","Hazrat Aaysha (Raziallahu anha) sey riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) unkey ghar tashrif laye to un ki eik azad karda londi chhup gaee, Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : usey haiz aa gaya hai? Ummul-mominin ney kaha : ji haan. aap (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney apni pagdi key kapdey mein sey phaad kar eik hissa usey diya aur farmaya : isey odhni bana lo."
"655","Hazrat Aaysha (Raziallahu anha) sey riwayat hai, Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : Allah Taala kisi baligh aurat ki namaz odhni key baghair qubul nahin karta."
"656","Hazrat Muaaza (Rahimahullah) sey riwayat hai ke eik aurat ney Ummul-mominin Hazrat Aaysha (Raziallahu anha) sey sawal kiya, kya haiz wali aurat mahndi (ya koi doosra khizaab) laga sakti hai? Ummul-mominin (Raziallahu anha) ney farmaya : hum Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) key paas hoten aur khizaab laga leti thin, aap (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) hamen mana nahin farmatey they."
"657","Hazrat Ali (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : meri eik kalaai toot gaee, mainey Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) sey masla puchha to aap ney mujhey pattiyon par masah karney ka hukm diya.(Imam Ibne-Maja (Rahimahullah) key shagrid) Abul-Hasan bin Salma ney kaha, unhen Dubri ney Abdur-Razzaaq sey sabiqa riwayat ki tarah bayan kiya."
"658","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : mainey Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ko dekha ke Hazrat Husain bin Ali (Raziallahu anhuma) ko kandhey par uthaya huwa tha, aur unka lu'aab beh kar aap par gir raha tha."
"659","Hazrat Wayl bin Hajar (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : mainey dekha ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ki khidmat mein (pani ka) dol hazir kiya gaya, aap ney is mein sey pani ley kar kulli ki, phir dol mein kulli ki jo kastoori ki tarah ya kastoori sey pakizah tar thi aur aap ney dol sey bahar naak saaf ki."
"660","Imam Zohri ney Hazrat Mehmood bin Rabee (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat bayan ki aur ye wo Sahaba hain jinhen wo kulli yad thi jo Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney eik dol mein ki thi jis mein unkey eik kunwen sey pani liya gaya tha."
"661","Hazrat Abu-Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : koi aurat , dusri aurat key satar ko na dekhey, aur koi mard kisi mard key satar ko na dekhey."
"662","Hazrat Aaysha (Raziallahu anha) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : mainey Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ki sharmgaah ko kabhi nahin dekha. Abu-Bakar ney kaha : Aubu Nuaim (Hazrat Aaysha (Raziallahu anha) key ghulam ki bajaey) Hazrat Aaysha (Raziallahu anha) ki londi sey bayan kiya kartey they."
"663","Hazrat Abdullah bin Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney ghusle-janabat (sambhog ke bad naapaaki ka gusl) kiya, phir aap ko thodi si jagah (khushk) nazar aai jisey pani nahin pahuncha tha. chunanche aap ney apney baalon ko us jagah par nichod kar tar kar liya. Janab Is-haq ney apni hadees mein kaha ke aap ney apney baalon ko is par nichodaa."
"664","Hazrat Ali (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke eik aadmi Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir huwa aur arz kiya : mainey ghusle-janabat (sambhog ke bad naapaaki ka gusl) kiya aur Fajr ki namaz padhi. din chadha to mujhey eik nakhun key barabar jagah nazar aai jahan (ghusl key doran mein) pani nahin pahuncha tha. Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : agar to us jagah (geelaa) haath pher deta to kafi hota."
"665","Hazrat Anas (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke eik aadmi Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir huwa , usney wuzu kiya tha aur nakhun key barabar jagah chhod di thi, wahan pani nahin pahuncha tha. Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney usey farmaya : wapis ja kar achchhi tarah wuzu karo."
"666","Hazrat umr bin Khattab (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : Allah key Rasool (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney eik aadmi ko dekha ke usney wuzu kiya (lekin) paon par eik nakhun key barabar jagah (khushk) chhod di. aap (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney isey hukm diya ke dobara wuzu karey aur dobara namaz padhey. chunanche wo shakhs (wuzu karney key liye masjid sey) wapis chala gaya."
